const PHRASE_SRC = {"30% off":[["leader-109-31","Helen treated everyone from the office to that restaurant because she had a coupon for \u000130% off\u0002.","Helen 請全辦公室的人去那間餐廳,因為她有一張 7 折折價券。"]],"a cup of":[["guide-111-43","Do you feel like having \u0001a cup of\u0002 hot tea?","你想喝杯熱茶嗎?"]],"a few minutes":[["guide-107-38","Would you mind waiting around here for \u0001a few minutes\u0002?","你介意在這附近等幾分鐘嗎?"]],"a glass of":[["guide-111-59","Can I have \u0001a glass of\u0002 water?",""]],"à la carte":[["leader-113-13","There are also vegetarian dishes on our \u0001à la carte\u0002 menu.",""]],"a must":[["guide-106-18","Standing on the observation deck to enjoy the breathtaking view is \u0001a must\u0002 when you visit this National Park.","站在觀景台欣賞令人屏息的景致,是造訪這座國家公園時的必做之事。"]],"a pair of":[["leader-110-36","I only bought \u0001a pair of\u0002 blue jeans at US$20, but here it says US$40. You seem to have overcharged me.","我只買一條 20 美元的牛仔褲,但這裡寫 40 美元。你好像多收我錢了。"]],"a party of five":[["guide-109-5","Guest: I'd like to reserve a table for \u0001a party of five\u0002 tonight at 7 o'clock, please. Receptionist: Sorry, I'm afraid we are all booked up for tonight.","客人:我想訂今晚 7 點五人的位子。 櫃台:抱歉,我們今晚恐怕都訂滿了。"]],"a quarter past":[["leader-111-5","The coach is leaving Taipei on Friday half an hour later, at a quarter to seven in the morning, not \u0001a quarter past\u0002 six.","遊覽車週五晚半小時離開台北,在早上六點四十五分(差一刻到七點),而非六點十五分。"]],"a quarter to":[["leader-109-62","We need to relax after our busy morning. Why don't we have a coffee break at \u0001a quarter to\u0002 eleven?","忙了一早該放鬆了。我們何不在差一刻到 11 點(10:45)喝杯咖啡休息?"],["leader-111-5","The coach is leaving Taipei on Friday half an hour later, at \u0001a quarter to\u0002 seven in the morning, not a quarter past six.","遊覽車週五晚半小時離開台北,在早上六點四十五分(差一刻到七點),而非六點十五分。"]],"a sense of wonder":[["guide-109-76","By spinning the globe and booking a flight to a country you know little about, you'll infuse the journey with \u0001a sense of wonder\u0002.","",1]],"a wide array of":[["leader-107-34","Hawaiian Airlines is proud to offer you a taste of the islands even before you land! You'll enjoy \u0001a wide array of\u0002 complimentary drinks to make your flight as enjoyable as possible.","夏威夷航空很自豪能在你降落前就給你海島風情!你將享用多樣的免費招待飲料,讓航程盡可能愉快。"]],"abide by":[["leader-113-68","Tourists should always \u0001abide by\u0002 the rules and regulations of the national parks they visit to preserve the natural environment.","遊客應始終遵守所造訪國家公園的規章,以保護自然環境。"],["guide-114-16","\u0001Abide by\u0002 all safety rules when enjoying theme-park facilities. To stay safe, listen to what staff members say and follow their instructions.","玩主題樂園設施時,請遵守所有安全規定。為了安全,聽從工作人員的話並遵循指示。"]],"account for":[["guide-106-67","The theory proposed by the distinguished geologist can reasonably \u0001account for\u0002 the formation of this type of landscapes.","這位傑出地質學家提出的理論能合理解釋這類地貌的形成。"]],"acquired taste":[["leader-108-76","Unfamiliar foods can be delicious, or they can be more of an \u0001acquired taste\u0002.","",1]],"across from":[["leader-107-44","Then take your first right and it is \u0001across from\u0002 the bus station.",""]],"across the street":[["guide-109-47","A: Could you please tell me the way to the Empire State Building? B: Take exit 4 and you'll see it \u0001across the street\u0002.","A:能告訴我怎麼去帝國大廈嗎? B:走 4 號出口,你就會看到它在對街。"]],"add up to":[["leader-115-61","Let me calculate your bill for you. It all \u0001adds up to\u0002 NT$15,000, Sir.","先生,我幫您算帳,全部加起來總共台幣 15,000 元。"],["guide-107-19","The forest resource in Taiwan \u0001adds up to\u0002 around 58 percent of the size of the island.","台灣的森林資源加總約達全島面積的 58%。"]],"add value":[["leader-115-42","Passengers simply \u0001add value\u0002 to a smart card and swipe it at the gate to enter. The fare is automatically deducted.","乘客只要為智慧卡加值,在閘門刷卡進入,車資就會自動扣除。"]],"additional charge":[["leader-108-6","A courtesy room is a room in a hotel made available to guests for a short period of time at no \u0001additional charge\u0002.","禮遇房是飯店免費提供給客人短時間使用的房間。"]],"adhere to":[["guide-113-63","Taiwanese night markets have evolved over the years from small, local gatherings to noisy streets lined with vendors who must \u0001adhere to\u0002 regulations placed on their goods and activities.","台灣夜市多年來已從小型的在地聚集,演變成兩旁林立攤販的喧鬧街道,這些攤販必須遵守對其商品與活動所訂的規定。"]],"admission fee":[["leader-106-36","Tourist: What is the \u0001admission fee\u0002? Receptionist: It's free.","遊客:門票多少錢? 櫃台:免費。"],["leader-114-51","Peggy: Do you know if there's an \u0001admission fee\u0002 to get into the museum? John: Yes, it's $15 for adults and $10 for students.","Peggy:你知道進博物館要入場費嗎? John:要,成人 15 元,學生 10 元。"]],"adventure travel":[["guide-109-80","“Spinning the globe and booking a flight to a country you know little about” is a promotion of \u0001adventure travel\u0002.","「轉動地球儀,訂一張機票飛往你幾乎不了解的國家」是在推廣什麼?"]],"after all":[["leader-114-8","I didn't expect to meet such friendly people. It turned out to be a great day \u0001after all\u0002, despite the misfortune earlier in the day.","我沒想到會遇到這麼友善的人。儘管當天稍早遇到不幸,結果這還是很棒的一天。"],["leader-114-59","Don't drink. \u0001After all\u0002, when you're sober, you're more likely to have a solid night of sleep.","別喝酒。畢竟,當你清醒(沒喝酒)時,比較可能睡個好覺。"]],"afternoon tea":[["leader-110-70","John: You really like the \u0001afternoon tea\u0002 at Paul's, right?",""]],"ahead of time":[["leader-107-15","One advice for travelers is to plan your itinerary \u0001ahead of time\u0002, but also prepare to be flexible.","給旅客的一個建議是提前規劃你的行程,但也要準備好保持彈性。"]],"air conditioning":[["leader-110-25","It's pretty hot today. Would you mind turning up the \u0001air conditioning\u0002 a little?","今天很熱。你介意把冷氣開強一點嗎?"],["guide-113-64","Customer: Hello, can you send someone to look at the \u0001air conditioning\u0002 in my room.",""]],"air traffic controller":[["leader-111-69","Pilots and \u0001air traffic controllers\u0002 are all proficient in aviation English as well as everyday English.","機師和航管人員都精通航空英語和日常英語。"]],"air-traffic controller":[["leader-115-40","As a result of disruption caused by the \u0001air-traffic controllers\u0002' strike, our flight couldn't land in Paris.","由於航管人員罷工造成的混亂/中斷,我們的班機無法在巴黎降落。"]],"airline ticket":[["guide-108-26","If you want to find the cheapest \u0001airline tickets\u0002, bargains can usually be found online for best fares.","想找最便宜的機票,通常能在網路上找到優惠拿到最好的價格。"]],"Airport MRT":[["guide-115-56","Normally, the earliest \u0001Airport MRT\u0002 from Taoyuan International Airport to the Taoyuan HSR Station departs at 6:02 A.M.","通常,從桃園國際機場到桃園高鐵站最早的機場捷運在早上 6:02 發車。"]],"aisle seat":[["leader-110-13","Passenger: Could I have an \u0001aisle seat\u0002?",""],["leader-115-51","During a crowded flight, she requested \u0001aisle seat\u0002 to avoid disturbing neighbors when standing up.","在擁擠的班機上,她要求走道座位,以免起身時打擾鄰座。"]],"Alishan Sacred Tree":[["guide-106-37","Famous for being the oldest tree in Taiwan, the \u0001Alishan Sacred Tree\u0002 is estimated to be about 3,000 years old.","阿里山神木以台灣最老的樹聞名,據估計約有 3,000 歲。"]],"all set":[["guide-113-6","Driver: We're \u0001all set\u0002 to go, sir.",""]],"all the way":[["guide-107-37","A: Are you going to drive \u0001all the way\u0002 to Taitung? B: No, we'll stop by in Kaohsiung for a night.","A:你要一路開車到台東嗎? B:不,我們會在高雄過一夜。"]],"all walks of life":[["guide-107-8","Tour guides will meet guests from all over the globe and \u0001all walks of life\u0002, so the best guides need to be sensitive to cultural differences.","導遊會遇到來自世界各地、各行各業的客人,所以最好的導遊要對文化差異敏感。"]],"all year round":[["leader-106-60","In some countries in Southern Asia, the climate is scorching hot \u0001all year round\u0002.","在南亞某些國家,氣候全年都炎熱難耐。"]],"allergic to":[["guide-110-40","I am \u0001allergic to\u0002 pork. Is there any in this Pepper Bun?","我對豬肉過敏。這個胡椒餅裡有任何(豬肉)嗎?"]],"allude to":[["guide-114-46","Many explorer travelers \u0001allude to\u0002 spiritual or transcendental motivations for seeking out risky and far-away places.","許多探險型旅人把尋找危險、遙遠地點的動機歸諸/提及於精神或超凡的追求。"]],"alternative fuels":[["leader-115-76","…ons and an acceleration of climate action overall, it will have to join forces to strengthen the innovation needed for new technologies and \u0001alternative fuels\u0002 to decouple Travel & Tourism growth rates from resource use and emissions for a net zero future.","",1],["leader-115-80","Increasing the use of new technologies and alternative fuels","增加新技術與替代燃料的使用",3]],"altitude sickness":[["guide-106-16","Tourist deaths have been linked to \u0001altitude sickness\u0002, floods, and hiking accidents over the past decades at Machu Picchu.","過去數十年,馬丘比丘的旅客死亡與高山症、洪水及健行意外有關。"],["guide-115-32","Elevations above 700 meters may trigger symptoms of \u0001altitude sickness\u0002 in some individuals, including rapid breathing, increased heart rate, fatigue, asthma, nausea, and vomiting.","海拔 700 公尺以上可能在某些人身上引發高山症的症狀,包括呼吸急促、心跳加快、疲勞、氣喘、噁心與嘔吐。"]],"American Express":[["leader-108-17","Hotel clerk: Yes, but we don't accept \u0001American Express\u0002.",""]],"amusement park":[["guide-106-60","Exhausted but happy, the children soon fell into sleep on the bus after playing for a whole day in the \u0001amusement park\u0002.","在遊樂園玩了一整天後,孩子們筋疲力盡卻很開心,很快就在車上睡著了。"],["guide-111-2","I went to the \u0001amusement park\u0002 last week and had a blast.","我上週去了遊樂園,玩得超開心。"]],"another day":[["guide-113-67","What time do people usually have to check out of the hotel if they don't want to pay for \u0001another day\u0002?","如果不想多付一天的錢,人們通常必須幾點退房?"]],"appeal to":[["leader-110-73","Businesses use the term \"low-impact tourism\" to appeal to travelers without actually having responsible policies.","企業用「低衝擊觀光」名號吸客卻無實際環保政策。",3]],"application form":[["leader-110-40","You need to fill in this \u0001application form\u0002 and also provide me all receipts that you need to refund, and a 5% fee will be charged.",""],["leader-111-23","Those who overstay their visa need to fill out an \u0001application form\u0002, provide a copy of passport, and book a ticket to leave the country in 7 days.","逾期居留者須填申請表、提供護照影本,並訂一張 7 天內離境的機票。"]],"apply to":[["leader-110-21","Clerk: Yes, but the discount doesn't \u0001apply to\u0002 sales items.",""]],"area code":[["leader-111-37","If you are calling a(n) landline from one city to another, you need to dial the \u0001area code\u0002.","如果你從一個城市打市話到另一個城市,需要撥區碼。"],["guide-112-13","Do I need to dial the international \u0001area code\u0002 while making a call abroad?","打國際電話時,我需要撥國際區碼嗎?"]],"around the corner":[["guide-107-34","A: Do you know where the nearest washroom is? B: It's right \u0001around the corner\u0002.","A:你知道最近的洗手間在哪嗎? B:就在轉角處。"],["guide-109-10","Chinese New Year is \u0001around the corner\u0002. I have a lot of shopping to do in just a few days.","農曆新年即將到來,我這幾天有很多東西要買。"]],"Arrival Card":[["guide-112-4","Foreigners without an ROC (Taiwan) Resident Certificate are required to fill in an \u0001Arrival Card\u0002.","沒有中華民國(台灣)居留證的外國人須填寫入境登記卡。"]],"as opposed to":[["guide-107-46","If all of us travel to Penghu by ferry \u0001as opposed to\u0002 flying, we could save up to 10,000 dollars.","如果我們全都搭渡輪去澎湖而非搭飛機,可省下多達一萬元。"]],"as soon as":[["guide-106-21","\u0001As soon as\u0002 the other passengers get on the bus, we'll leave.","其他乘客一…就上車,我們就出發。"]],"assembly point":[["guide-113-59","During the tour, the guide highlighted the \u0001assembly point\u0002 in case the group got separated in the crowded area.","導覽途中,導遊特別說明了集合點,以防團體在擁擠處走散。"]],"assistive device":[["guide-114-18","The medical \u0001assistive devices\u0002 used by passengers may not exceed 125 cm in length, 90 cm in width, and 185 cm in height.","乘客使用的醫療輔助裝置不得超過長 125 公分、寬 90 公分、高 185 公分。"]],"at a cost of":[["guide-107-55","The museum audio guide is available in several languages, \u0001at a cost of\u0002 NT$150 per rental.","博物館語音導覽有多種語言,每台租用收費新台幣 150 元。"]],"at least":[["guide-109-9","Willie is addicted to coffee. He must drink \u0001at least\u0002 five cups of coffee every day.","威利對咖啡上癮,他每天至少要喝五杯咖啡。"]],"at once":[["leader-115-55","This is a non-smoking restaurant. Please put out your cigarette \u0001at once\u0002.","這是禁菸餐廳,請立刻熄滅你的香菸。"]],"audio guide":[["guide-107-54","The National Palace Museum provides a special children's \u0001audio guide\u0002 to allow children to learn more about the exhibitions on display.","故宮提供兒童專屬語音導覽,讓孩子更了解展出的展品。"],["guide-107-55","The museum \u0001audio guide\u0002 is available in several languages, at a cost of NT$150 per rental.","博物館語音導覽有多種語言,每台租用收費新台幣 150 元。"]],"Augmented Reality":[["guide-108-77","Applications of technologies such as VR (Virtual Reality), AR (\u0001Augmented Reality\u0002) and MR (Mixed Reality) in tourism have expanded the market and created revolutionary business opportunities.","",4]],"aurora borealis":[["leader-114-72","The aurora borealis","極光",3]],"aware of":[["leader-112-73","Green consumers are those who are \u0001aware of\u0002 and interested in environmental issues.","",4]],"away from":[["leader-110-51","Jean always puts gloves on to keep her hands \u0001away from\u0002 water when she washes the dishes.","Jean 洗碗時總戴上手套,讓手遠離水。"]],"bad habit":[["guide-107-24","Many people have tried to give up \u0001bad habits\u0002 at some point in their lives.","許多人一生中某個時刻都試過戒除壞習慣。"]],"bad luck":[["guide-109-13","People decorate their homes with plastic firecrackers to ward off \u0001bad luck\u0002.","人們用塑膠鞭炮裝飾家裡,以驅趕厄運。"]],"bag tag":[["guide-114-69","You can check in your baggage smoothly in the airport by using a self-service check-in kiosk, which issues a \u0001bag tag\u0002 for you to attach to your baggage, and then go to the Self Baggage Drop.","你可以在機場使用自助報到機台順利託運行李,它會印出行李條讓你貼在行李上,接著再前往自助行李託運處。"]],"baggage allowance":[["leader-113-53","Lisa: Hey John, have you checked the \u0001baggage allowance\u0002 for our flight? John: Not yet, but I think we're allowed two bags each.","Lisa:John,你查過我們航班的行李額度了嗎? John:還沒,但我想每人可帶兩件。"],["guide-108-51","The \u0001baggage allowance\u0002 for economy class is 20 kilos.",""]],"baggage claim":[["leader-111-28","Reclaim on Demand is an automated system designed for the future of \u0001baggage claim\u0002. It gives passengers visibility into when and where their bags will appear.","「隨需提領」是為行李提領未來設計的自動化系統,讓旅客能得知行李何時、何處出現。"],["leader-115-32","baggage claim","行李提領",2]],"baggage claim area":[["guide-112-52","B: We have been waiting in the \u0001baggage claim area\u0002 for one and a half hours, but some of our group members still can't find their luggage.",""]],"baggage claim tag":[["leader-113-24","Staff: May I see your \u0001baggage claim tag\u0002, please?",""]],"banquet server":[["leader-106-35","A: Which job might require some catering or culinary experience? B: \u0001Banquet server\u0002.","A:哪個工作可能需要一些外燴或烹飪經驗? B:宴會服務生。"]],"banqueting hall":[["leader-109-61","Clerk: Will a \u0001banqueting hall\u0002 that holds 200 people be sufficient? Guest: No, I need a large space for more than 250 people.","人員:一個可容 200 人的宴會廳夠嗎? 客人:不夠,我需要能容納 250 人以上的大空間。"]],"barrier lake":[["guide-109-70","Caoling's new “flying mountain” and \u0001barrier lake\u0002 attracted the attention of the public, sparking a new wave of tourism.","草嶺新形成的「飛山」與堰塞湖吸引了大眾目光,掀起一波新的觀光熱潮。"]],"base salary":[["guide-112-24","Most tour guides earn commission on sales in addition to their \u0001base salary\u0002.","大多數導遊除了底薪外,還從銷售中賺取佣金。"]],"be addicted to":[["guide-109-9","Willie \u0001is addicted to\u0002 coffee. He must drink at least five cups of coffee every day.","威利對咖啡上癮,他每天至少要喝五杯咖啡。"]],"be allowed to":[["guide-107-35","A: Are we \u0001allowed to\u0002 take pictures once we get inside the museum? B: Taking pictures inside the museum is prohibited.","A:進博物館後可以拍照嗎? B:博物館內禁止拍照。"]],"be bound to":[["guide-110-73","Which of the following may replace “you \u0001are bound to\u0002” in the second paragraph of the above passage?","下列何者可替換本文第二段的「you are bound to」?"]],"be covered with":[["guide-108-36","Unlike western-style ice cream, shaved ice is a distinctive Taiwanese dessert. People enjoy ice \u0001covered with\u0002 fruit or other tasty toppings.","不同於西式冰淇淋,剉冰是獨特的台灣甜點。人們享用覆蓋著水果或其他美味配料的冰。"]],"be decorated with":[["guide-108-41","During Chinese New Year, houses \u0001are decorated with\u0002 fresh flowers, Spring Festival Couplets and traditional lucky knots.","農曆新年期間,家家戶戶裝飾著鮮花、春聯和傳統吉祥結。"]],"be dedicated to":[["guide-108-32","Through holding many festivals and exhibitions, the government \u0001is dedicated to\u0002 promoting Taiwanese traditional crafts and performing arts.","政府透過舉辦許多節慶與展覽,致力於推廣台灣傳統工藝與表演藝術。"]],"be filled with":[["guide-107-22","Bubble tea has been popular in Taiwan, and the city \u0001is filled with\u0002 tea stores.","珍珠奶茶在台灣一直很受歡迎,城市裡滿是茶飲店。"]],"be forced to":[["guide-112-44","Only when David was stopped by a policeman for drunk driving did he realize that his passport had expired and he \u0001was forced to\u0002 return home.","直到 David 因酒駕被警察攔下,他才意識到護照已過期,並被迫返國。"]],"be headed":[["guide-107-33","We are headed off at the airport","語意不通",2]],"be home to":[["guide-110-72","Which of the following explains “Taiwan \u0001is home to\u0002 many breathtaking mountains, hills, and valleys”?","下列何者解釋了「Taiwan is home to many breathtaking mountains, hills, and valleys」?"]],"be made up of":[["guide-108-35","Oyster omelets \u0001are made up of\u0002 eggs, oysters, and vegetables and are eaten with special sauce.","蚵仔煎由蛋、牡蠣和蔬菜組成,並沾特製醬料食用。"]],"be made with":[["guide-107-23","Pineapple cake, one of Taiwan's best food souvenirs, \u0001is made with\u0002 pineapples or winter melon.","鳳梨酥是台灣最棒的伴手禮之一,是用鳳梨或冬瓜製成。"]],"be noted for":[["guide-115-52","Changhua \u0001is noted for\u0002 its many temples as well as its unique local delicacies, such as ba-wan, mao-shu noodle, and braised pork with rice.","彰化以眾多廟宇聞名,也以獨特的在地美食著稱,例如肉圓、貓鼠麵與滷肉飯。"]],"be sure to":[["guide-108-4","Before you leave the bus, \u0001be sure to\u0002 take all of your belongings with you.","下車前,務必帶走你所有的隨身物品。"]],"be worth":[["leader-109-21","Customer: What is the exchange rate for Indian rupee? Clerk: One Indian rupee \u0001is worth\u0002 about 1.5 Japanese yen today.","顧客:印度盧比的匯率是多少? 櫃台:今天一印度盧比約值 1.5 日圓。"]],"behavior pattern":[["guide-108-79","What kind of tool do people in the tourism industry use to analyze travelers' \u0001behavior patterns\u0002, change the way they interact with tourists, and seize future business opportunities?","觀光業者用哪種工具分析旅客行為模式、改變互動方式並掌握未來商機?"]],"behind schedule":[["guide-106-48","We're \u0001behind schedule\u0002.",""]],"beware of":[["leader-113-1","Visitors of the national park should \u0001beware of\u0002 falling rocks on the road and trails, especially after heavy rains, typhoons and earthquakes.","國家公園遊客應當心路上和步道的落石,尤其在大雨、颱風和地震後。"],["guide-108-48","\u0001Beware of\u0002 strangers at the airport and do not leave your personal items unattended.","在機場要提防陌生人,別讓私人物品無人看管。"]],"beyond imagination":[["guide-110-23","Do we want to become a country where the top tier remains wealthy \u0001beyond imagination\u0002, and the rest are working in jobs that help make the lives of the rich more comfortable?","我們想成為一個上層階級富有到超乎想像、其餘人卻在替富人讓生活更舒適的工作中打拼的國家嗎?"]],"big data":[["guide-108-79","From the perspective of the tourism industry, \u0001big data\u0002 plus travel technologies means huge business opportunities.","",4]],"bike sharing":[["guide-113-40","In Taiwan, Youbike is virtually synonymous with public \u0001bike sharing\u0002.","在台灣,YouBike 幾乎與公共自行車共享同義(畫上等號)。"]],"black-faced spoonbill":[["guide-106-63","The scientists used tiny GPS receivers to track the migration routes of \u0001black-faced spoonbills\u0002—birds that fly thousands of kilometers to Taiwan.","科學家用微型 GPS 接收器追蹤黑面琵鷺的遷徙路線——這種鳥飛行數千公里來到台灣。"]],"blood bank":[["guide-110-50","According to a newspaper report, blood supplies are running low across Taiwan, with \u0001blood banks\u0002 reporting an average of less than five days of stock.","根據報導,全台血液供應吃緊,血庫平均庫存不到五天。"]],"blow on":[["leader-114-62","To have good table manners please gently stir your soup to cool it instead of \u0001blowing on\u0002 it during the meal.","為有好的餐桌禮儀,用餐時請輕輕攪拌你的湯讓它變涼,而不是用嘴吹。"]],"blue jeans":[["leader-110-36","I only bought a pair of \u0001blue jeans\u0002 at US$20, but here it says US$40. You seem to have overcharged me.","我只買一條 20 美元的牛仔褲,但這裡寫 40 美元。你好像多收我錢了。"]],"boarding pass":[["leader-114-37","I've lost my bag, and my passport and \u0001boarding pass\u0002 were in it.",""],["guide-109-46","In addition to your passport, you need a \u0001boarding pass\u0002 that lets you pass through security and into the airport.","除了護照,你還需要一張登機證才能通過安檢進入機場。"]],"book up":[["guide-115-3","Top accommodations can be \u0001booked up\u0002 weeks or even months in advance, so it's best to plan ahead before travelling abroad.","頂級住宿可能提前數週甚至數月就被訂滿,所以出國前最好提早規劃。"]],"booked up":[["guide-109-5","Guest: I'd like to reserve a table for a party of five tonight at 7 o'clock, please. Receptionist: Sorry, I'm afraid we are all \u0001booked up\u0002 for tonight.","客人:我想訂今晚 7 點五人的位子。 櫃台:抱歉,我們今晚恐怕都訂滿了。"]],"bottle rocket":[["guide-115-49","The Yanshui Fireworks Festival involves shooting tens of thousands of \u0001bottle rockets\u0002 and fireworks not into the sky, but directly into crowds of willing participants.","鹽水蜂炮節會發射數以萬計的沖天炮與煙火,不是射向天空,而是直接射向自願參與的人群。"]],"bottom line":[["leader-106-47","While both a social business and a business run by an entrepreneur need to be profitable, the \u0001bottom line\u0002 for a social business is how much impact it makes on society.","社會企業和創業者經營的企業都需要獲利,但社會企業的底線是它對社會造成多少影響。"]],"bound for":[["guide-114-62","This train is \u0001bound for\u0002 Nangang.",""]],"braised pork":[["guide-112-5","Guabao, a steamed sandwich, resembles a hamburger that has a soft white bun filled with \u0001braised pork\u0002, pickled vegetables, peanut powder, and cilantro.","刈包是一種蒸的三明治,類似漢堡,有柔軟的白麵皮,夾著滷肉、酸菜、花生粉和香菜。"],["guide-115-52","Changhua is noted for its many temples as well as its unique local delicacies, such as ba-wan, mao-shu noodle, and \u0001braised pork\u0002 with rice.","彰化以眾多廟宇聞名,也以獨特的在地美食著稱,例如肉圓、貓鼠麵與滷肉飯。"]],"brand image":[["guide-111-15","Tourism is vital to the economy of a country; as a result, the National Tourism Authorities always try to promote its national \u0001brand image\u0002.","觀光對一國經濟至關重要;因此,國家觀光機關總是努力推廣其國家品牌形象。"]],"break up":[["leader-114-22","At the large, unruly gathering, glass bottles and cans were thrown at police officers as they tried to \u0001break up\u0002 the crowd.","在那場大型失序的聚集中,玻璃瓶和罐子被扔向警察,警察試圖驅散人群。"]],"bring about":[["guide-106-76","To explain how global warming brings about an ice age","說明全球暖化如何導致冰河期",3]],"bubble tea":[["leader-112-30","\u0001Bubble tea\u0002 most commonly consists of tea accompanied by chewy tapioca balls (\"boba\" or \"pearls\").","珍珠奶茶最常見是茶加上有嚼勁的木薯(粉圓)球(即「波霸」或「珍珠」)。"],["guide-107-22","\u0001Bubble tea\u0002 has been popular in Taiwan, and the city is filled with tea stores.","珍珠奶茶在台灣一直很受歡迎,城市裡滿是茶飲店。"]],"buckle up":[["leader-108-30","Every passenger should \u0001buckle up\u0002 for the roller-coaster ride and keep arms and legs inside the vehicle at all times.","每位乘客搭雲霄飛車都應繫好安全帶,並隨時把手腳保持在車內。"]],"buffet restaurant":[["guide-112-70","Hotel clerk: We have a bar, a gym, a swimming pool, tennis courts and a \u0001buffet restaurant\u0002.",""]],"buffet style":[["guide-112-30","A: Does your restaurant supply a continental breakfast? B: Yes, we do, and it's served in a \u0001buffet style\u0002.","A:你們餐廳有供應歐陸式早餐嗎? B:有的,而且是自助式的。"]],"built-up area":[["guide-114-35","Drink stores can be found practically anywhere in \u0001built-up areas\u0002 in Taiwan. Most of the beverages at these places involve tea.","在台灣的鬧區幾乎到處都能找到飲料店。這些店裡大部分的飲料都含茶。"]],"bunches of":[["guide-109-78","“\u0001Bunches of\u0002 selfie sticks” is an indication of tourist crowd.","「成堆的自拍棒」代表什麼?"]],"Bureau of Consular Affairs":[["guide-110-59","The Visitor Visa Application Form can be downloaded from the website of the \u0001Bureau of Consular Affairs\u0002, Ministry of Foreign Affairs.","訪客簽證申請表可從外交部領事事務局的網站下載。"]],"bus fare":[["guide-112-56","Passenger: What's the \u0001bus fare\u0002 to The Metropolitan Museum of Art? John: Two dollars one way, three dollars round trip.","乘客:到大都會藝術博物館的公車票價多少? John:單程兩美元,來回三美元。"]],"bus service":[["guide-107-44","The \u0001bus service\u0002 is unavailable until eight o'clock on Monday morning.","公車服務直到週一早上八點前都無法使用。"]],"bus station":[["leader-111-1","If you take this shortcut, maybe you can get to the \u0001bus station\u0002 in 15 minutes.","如果你走這條捷徑,或許 15 分鐘就能到公車站。"]],"bus tour":[["leader-110-26","Guest: I would like to make a reservation for the \u0001bus tour\u0002 tomorrow.",""]],"business center":[["leader-109-8","The hotel is equipped with a \u0001business center\u0002 and a gym.","這間飯店配備商務中心和健身房。"]],"business class":[["leader-108-9","Due to the overbooking, we will upgrade you to \u0001business class\u0002.","由於超額訂位,我們將為你升等到商務艙。"],["leader-111-70","Passenger: Is there any chance for a(n) upgrade to the \u0001business class\u0002? Check-in clerk: Let me check if there are any business class seats available.","乘客:有機會升等到商務艙嗎? 報到人員:讓我查查有沒有空的商務艙座位。"]],"business traveler":[["leader-113-72","Non-stop flights are mostly sought-after for \u0001business travelers\u0002 who value time.","",4]],"business trip":[["guide-107-31","Customs: What is the purpose of your visit? Tourist: I am on a \u0001business trip\u0002.","海關:你此行的目的是什麼? 旅客:我是來出差的。"]],"butter up":[["guide-111-1","It was so obvious that he was just trying to \u0001butter up\u0002 his boss in order to get a raise.","很明顯他只是想奉承老闆以求加薪。"]],"by all means":[["leader-107-22","by all means","務必",2]],"by ferry":[["guide-107-46","If all of us travel to Penghu \u0001by ferry\u0002 as opposed to flying, we could save up to 10,000 dollars.","如果我們全都搭渡輪去澎湖而非搭飛機,可省下多達一萬元。"]],"by the window":[["guide-111-58","A: Is it OK if we sit \u0001by the window\u0002? B: Sure, I'll help you move over there.","A:我們可以坐窗邊嗎? B:當然,我幫你們移過去。"]],"cabin crew":[["leader-109-26","Our \u0001cabin crew\u0002 here will serve you to your satisfaction during your long flight from Taipei to New York.",""]],"call at":[["guide-114-62","The train will also \u0001call at\u0002 Hsinchu, Taoyuan, and Banqiao.",""]],"call it a day":[["guide-107-42","Let's \u0001call it a day\u0002, shall we?","我們今天就到此為止,好嗎?"]],"calm down":[["leader-110-18","B: \u0001Calm down\u0002!",""],["leader-112-69","Please \u0001calm down\u0002 and tell me what happened.",""]],"car rental":[["leader-109-34","The agent in a \u0001car rental\u0002 company guaranteed that he would reserve a car for Nancy if she could pay a deposit to confirm her reservation.","租車公司的專員保證,只要 Nancy 付訂金確認,就會為她預留一輛車。"]],"carbon dioxide":[["guide-112-71","The aviation sector has released huge amounts of \u0001carbon dioxide\u0002 (CO2) into the atmosphere every year.","",1]],"care about":[["leader-110-57","For Jean, the price is the least important thing when she shops for jeans. She \u0001cares even more about\u0002 the shape and the size of pockets.","對 Jean 來說,買牛仔褲時價格是最不重要的。她更在意口袋的形狀和大小。"]],"carry-on bag":[["leader-111-4","Guest: Could you please help me put my \u0001carry-on bag\u0002 into the overhead compartment? Flight attendant: Yes, no problem.","旅客:能幫我把隨身行李放進頭頂置物櫃嗎? 空服員:好的,沒問題。"],["leader-111-25","Your suitcase exceeds the weight limit by two kilograms. You might want to give up some items, or put them away in your \u0001carry-on bag\u0002.","你的行李箱超過重量限制兩公斤。你可以捨棄一些物品,或放進隨身行李。"]],"carry-on baggage":[["guide-110-31","Where do we store \u0001carry-on baggage\u0002 on the plane?","我們要把隨身行李放在飛機上哪裡?"],["guide-114-63","To ensure flight safety, passengers are to safely stow their \u0001carry-on baggage\u0002 under the seat or in the overhead baggage compartment to prevent them from sliding or falling off.","為確保飛航安全,旅客應將隨身行李妥善收放在座位下方或頭頂上方的行李櫃,以防滑動或掉落。"]],"carry-on luggage":[["leader-109-17","When going through the security check, you need to put all \u0001carry-on luggage\u0002 on the conveyor.","通過安檢時,你需要把所有隨身行李放上輸送帶。"],["leader-114-12","Due to the restrictions on the size of the \u0001carry-on luggage\u0002, it can be challenging to choose the ideal personal bag for flights.","由於隨身行李尺寸的限制,要選到理想的個人包包可能很有挑戰性。"]],"cash dispenser":[["leader-106-48","If you need some cash, the new credit card will allow you to withdraw up to $300 a day from a \u0001cash dispenser\u0002.","如果你需要現金,這張新信用卡讓你每天可從提款機提領最多 300 美元。"]],"cash register":[["leader-109-60","The tax is added to the total price at the \u0001cash register\u0002, not included in the price.","稅金在收銀台加到總價上,不含在標價內。"]],"cater to":[["leader-112-28","Muslim visitors to Taiwan will also find many restaurants and other facilities available to \u0001cater to\u0002 their dietary and religious needs.","來台的穆斯林旅客也會發現許多餐廳和其他設施能滿足他們的飲食與宗教需求。"],["leader-113-2","The Forestry and Nature Conservation Agency has been developing forest recreation sites to \u0001cater to\u0002 the citizens' leisure and entertainment needs.","林業及自然保育署一直在開發森林遊憩場所,以滿足民眾休閒娛樂需求。"]],"chain restaurant":[["leader-106-76","\u0001Chain restaurants\u0002 and stores may not always serve local food or sell local products.","",1]],"check in":[["leader-114-44","check in","入住",2],["leader-115-2","Guests \u0001checked in\u0002 at the hotel reception before going to their rooms.","客人先在飯店接待櫃台辦理入住,然後才進房間。"]],"check on":[["guide-109-22","I'll \u0001check on\u0002 it right now.",""]],"check out":[["leader-110-19","Guest: I would like to \u0001check out\u0002, please.",""],["leader-114-44","Roger: What time do we need to \u0001check out\u0002 of the hotel tomorrow? Alice: We should do it before 11 a.m. to avoid extra charges.","Roger:我們明天幾點要退房? Alice:應該在上午 11 點前,以免額外收費。"]],"check-in counter":[["guide-110-36","Could you tell me where the \u0001check-in counter\u0002 for Lufthansa is?","你能告訴我漢莎航空的報到櫃台在哪裡嗎?"]],"checked baggage":[["leader-112-8","Normally, \u0001checked baggage\u0002 will be delivered to the carousel after the flight arrives, depending on the priority and the position of baggage.","通常班機抵達後,託運行李會送到行李轉盤,順序視優先級和行李位置而定。"],["leader-112-43","Each passenger can have two pieces of \u0001checked baggage\u0002 allowance and one carry-on bag.","每位乘客可有兩件託運行李額度和一件隨身行李。"]],"checked luggage":[["leader-113-23","Tour Leader: I'd like you to check if you put any lithium batteries, power bank or valuable items in your \u0001checked luggage\u0002. If you did, please move them to your carry-on bag.","領隊:我想請你檢查託運行李裡有沒有放鋰電池、行動電源或貴重物品。如果有,請把它們移到隨身行李。"]],"cheer up":[["leader-106-8","B: \u0001Cheer up\u0002.",""]],"cherry blossom":[["guide-108-23","Wuling Farm is a must-see destination with attractions of spring \u0001cherry blossoms\u0002 and autumn maples.","武陵農場是必訪景點,有春櫻與秋楓等美景。"]],"chicken nuggets":[["leader-109-39","The child is allergic to seafood. We should order \u0001chicken nuggets\u0002 instead of shrimps.","這孩子對海鮮過敏。我們該點雞塊而不是蝦。"]],"chicken wings":[["leader-107-18","We ordered two appetizers, \u0001chicken wings\u0002 and Mozzarella sticks, salad and soup before the main dish.","我們在主菜前點了兩道開胃菜——雞翅和莫札瑞拉起司條、沙拉和湯。"]],"Chinese New Year":[["guide-109-10","\u0001Chinese New Year\u0002 is around the corner. I have a lot of shopping to do in just a few days.","農曆新年即將到來,我這幾天有很多東西要買。"]],"city center":[["leader-106-13","There is a shuttle bus between the airport and the \u0001city center\u0002.","機場和市中心之間有接駁巴士。"]],"civil war":[["guide-106-55","The US has evacuated all the ambassadors and diplomatic staff because that country is on the verge of \u0001civil war\u0002.","美國已撤離所有大使與外交人員,因為那個國家正瀕臨內戰邊緣。"]],"claim tag":[["leader-112-6","A: Excuse me, I can't find my baggage. B: Do you have your \u0001claim tag\u0002?","A:不好意思,我找不到行李。 B:你有行李領取牌嗎?"]],"claim ticket":[["guide-109-62","A: My suitcase didn't appear on the carousel. B: Do you have your \u0001claim ticket\u0002?","A:我的行李箱沒出現在行李轉盤上。 B:你有行李領取單嗎?"]],"clay pot":[["leader-108-8","Tom: What's the signature dish of your restaurant? Attendant: \u0001Clay pot\u0002 chicken in fermented red rice wine.","Tom:你們餐廳的招牌菜是什麼? 服務員:紅糟醃雞煲。"]],"climate change":[["leader-107-4","\u0001Climate change\u0002 has become human's great damaging equalizer, leaving no part of the planet safe from the harm we do.","氣候變遷已成為人類巨大的破壞性均衡器,讓地球無一處能倖免於我們造成的傷害。"]],"climate target":[["leader-115-76","The analysis showed that 53% of the Travel & Tourism businesses analysed currently have publicly announced \u0001climate targets\u0002.","",1],["leader-115-77","What does the article say about many businesses' \u0001climate targets\u0002?","文章對許多企業的氣候目標怎麼說?"]],"climate zone":[["guide-114-57","Climbing over 2KM, the famous Alishan forest railway passes through several \u0001climate zones\u0002, including tropical, subtropical, temperate, and high-mountain forest ranges.","阿里山森林鐵路爬升超過 2 公里,穿越數個氣候帶,包括熱帶、亞熱帶、溫帶與高山森林帶。"]],"close to":[["guide-109-29","A: Could you please drive a little faster? B: Sorry, I'm already going very fast, \u0001close to\u0002 the speed limit.","A:能不能開快一點? B:抱歉,我已經開很快了,快到速限了。"]],"closely connected":[["guide-109-74","Because many people believe that love and chocolate are closely connected.","因為許多人認為愛與巧克力緊密相連。",3]],"closest in meaning":[["leader-111-73","Which word is \u0001closest in meaning\u0002 to the word \"hovering\" in the passage?","與文中 hovering 意思最接近的字是?"]],"coffee break":[["leader-109-62","We need to relax after our busy morning. Why don't we have a \u0001coffee break\u0002 at a quarter to eleven?","忙了一早該放鬆了。我們何不在差一刻到 11 點(10:45)喝杯咖啡休息?"]],"collared bush robin":[["guide-115-71","The inspiration for the Vivid Express came from the \u0001collared bush robin\u0002.","",1]],"collect call":[["leader-109-56","Since most people now travel with cell phones, \u0001collect calls\u0002 are rarely used and have become almost obsolete.","由於現在多數人旅行都帶手機,對方付費電話很少用,幾乎快絕跡了。"],["leader-110-22","Guest: It is a \u0001collect call\u0002.",""]],"collect points":[["leader-112-17","Airline mileage programs are designed to encourage customers to \u0001collect points\u0002 which may then be exchanged for air travel rewards.","航空哩程計畫旨在鼓勵旅客累積點數,之後可兌換航空旅遊獎勵。"]],"come with":[["leader-110-28","Does that \u0001come with\u0002 anything?",""],["guide-109-7","Today's lunch special is beef lasagna. It \u0001comes with\u0002 a medium coke.","今日午間特餐是牛肉千層麵,附一杯中杯可樂。"]],"commercial district":[["guide-115-29","The \u0001commercial district\u0002 in the city is now a trendy neighborhood with the perfect blend of past and present.","城裡的商業區如今是時尚街區,完美融合了過去與現在。"]],"concert hall":[["leader-109-12","Hotel Guest: Could you tell me how to get to the \u0001concert hall\u0002? Clerk: Yes, just go outside the hotel and turn left.","飯店客人:能告訴我怎麼去音樂廳嗎? 櫃台:可以,出飯店左轉就到。"]],"conduct business":[["guide-112-45","We have been committed to delivering the best service and are always working to \u0001conduct business\u0002 transactions as smoothly as possible.","我們一直致力於提供最好的服務,並始終努力讓業務交易盡可能順暢地進行。"]],"conference room":[["leader-113-20","Do you have a suitable \u0001conference room\u0002 available?",""]],"confirmation number":[["leader-111-66","I have a reservation for two nights and here is my \u0001confirmation number\u0002.",""]],"connecting flight":[["leader-109-9","Clerk: When is your \u0001connecting flight\u0002? Traveler: It comes in three hours.","人員:你的轉機是什麼時候? 旅客:三小時後。"],["leader-110-17","Traveler: I missed the \u0001connecting flight\u0002 due to the weather.",""]],"consist of":[["leader-106-33","Hong Kong \u0001consists of\u0002 two parts: Hong Kong Island and Kowloon, separated by Victoria Harbor.","香港由兩部分組成:香港島和九龍,以維多利亞港相隔。"],["guide-106-26","Hawaii, which \u0001consists of\u0002 eight principal islands, is a favorite vacation spot.","由八座主要島嶼組成的夏威夷,是熱門的度假勝地。"]],"contact details":[["leader-113-51","Just be sure to put a label with your \u0001contact details\u0002 on it.",""]],"contact lenses":[["leader-110-66","The medical service is very different from Taiwan to the US. In the US, you need a prescription to buy \u0001contact lenses\u0002.","美台醫療制度差很多。在美國,你需要處方箋才能買隱形眼鏡。"]],"contactless payment":[["leader-111-80","Growth of Contactless Payments","無接觸支付的成長",3]],"continental breakfast":[["guide-112-30","A: Does your restaurant supply a \u0001continental breakfast\u0002? B: Yes, we do, and it's served in a buffet style.","A:你們餐廳有供應歐陸式早餐嗎? B:有的,而且是自助式的。"]],"contribute to":[["leader-106-41","Traveling from one city or country to another can \u0001contribute to\u0002 the spread of disease.","從一個城市或國家到另一處旅行,可能助長疾病傳播。"],["leader-106-78","Which of the following might NOT \u0001contribute to\u0002 traditional mass tourism based on the excerpt?","根據本段,下列何者可能不屬於傳統大眾觀光?"]],"convenience store":[["leader-111-36","Tour leader: You can probably find one at a gas station or a \u0001convenience store\u0002.",""],["guide-107-48","The store adjacent to the hotel is a \u0001convenience store\u0002 which provides a range of everyday items such as groceries, snacks, or drinks.","飯店旁的便利商店提供各種日常用品,例如雜貨、零食或飲料。"]],"convert into":[["guide-111-20","Shopping has \u0001converted into\u0002 an essential factor for many tourists when choosing a travel destination.","對許多遊客而言,購物已轉變成選擇旅遊目的地時的重要因素。"]],"conveyor belt":[["leader-113-37","Please place your bags and shoes on the \u0001conveyor belt\u0002.",""]],"country code":[["guide-112-54","Tourist: Could you tell me the international \u0001country code\u0002 for France, please?",""]],"credit card":[["leader-106-48","If you need some cash, the new \u0001credit card\u0002 will allow you to withdraw up to $300 a day from a cash dispenser.","如果你需要現金,這張新信用卡讓你每天可從提款機提領最多 300 美元。"],["leader-109-25","I would like to settle the bill. Can I use a \u0001credit card\u0002 to pay for it?","我想結清帳單,能用信用卡付嗎?"]],"cross one's fingers":[["guide-114-13","Let's \u0001cross our fingers\u0002 that the worst of the storm misses us.","讓我們祈求好運,希望暴風雨最猛烈的部分別掃到我們。"]],"cruise ship":[["guide-110-9","Summertime is definitely the best time to visit Penghu Islands. There are eateries open the whole day, and mini \u0001cruise ships\u0002 would take you to fascinating places.","夏天絕對是造訪澎湖群島的最佳時機。整天都有餐館營業,迷你郵輪還會帶你到迷人的地方。"]],"culinary tourism":[["guide-111-14","\u0001Culinary tourism\u0002 is the exploration of food as the purpose and destination.","美食旅遊是把食物當作目的和目的地的探索。"]],"cultural difference":[["guide-107-8","Tour guides will meet guests from all over the globe and all walks of life, so the best guides need to be sensitive to \u0001cultural differences\u0002.","導遊會遇到來自世界各地、各行各業的客人,所以最好的導遊要對文化差異敏感。"]],"cultural mosaic":[["guide-110-71","As you make your way through different destinations, you are bound to encounter a \u0001cultural mosaic\u0002 of diverse highlights, traditions, and events.","",1],["guide-110-74","Which of the following is NOT related to “\u0001cultural mosaic\u0002” or “cultural appreciation”?","下列何者與「cultural mosaic(文化馬賽克)」或「cultural appreciation(文化欣賞)」「無關」?"]],"customs agent":[["leader-115-27","If you have nothing to declare, simply walk through the Green Channel, stopping only if asked to do so by a \u0001customs agent\u0002.","如果你沒有任何東西要申報,就直接走綠線通道,除非海關人員要求你停下。"]],"customs duty":[["leader-110-4","If the tobacco products we bring exceed the travelers' allowance, we may have to pay \u0001customs duties\u0002 and other charges.","如果我們攜帶的菸品超過旅客免稅額度,可能得付關稅和其他費用。"]],"Customs Duty":[["guide-111-10","\u0001Customs Duty\u0002 is a tax imposed on imports and exports of goods in accordance with the Customs Import Tariff.","關稅是依《海關進口稅則》對貨物進出口所課徵的稅。"]],"customs laws":[["leader-114-70","The inspector expressed his concerns about the lack of an adequate effort to enforce \u0001customs laws\u0002 along the border.","稽查員表達他對邊境缺乏足夠努力執行海關法規的擔憂。"]],"customs officer":[["leader-111-30","\u0001Customs officer\u0002: Do you have anything to declare? Traveler: Yes, I have NT$100,000 dollars in cash with me.","海關人員:你有任何東西要申報嗎? 旅客:有,我帶了 10 萬元台幣現金。"],["leader-113-69","\u0001Customs officer\u0002: Good morning.",""]],"daily life":[["guide-106-42","Though Mandarin Chinese is the official language of Taiwan, many people use Taiwanese in \u0001daily life\u0002.","雖然國語是台灣的官方語言,但許多人在日常生活使用台語。"]],"dairy cow":[["guide-114-37","Chu Lu Ranch in Taitung County is the largest hillside pasture in Taiwan. Herds of \u0001dairy cows\u0002 roam leisurely on the grassland.","台東縣的初鹿牧場是台灣最大的坡地牧場。成群的乳牛在草原上悠閒漫步。"]],"date back to":[["leader-113-3","This church \u0001dates back to\u0002 the mid-fourteenth century and houses a large number of remarkable statues and wall paintings.","這座教堂可追溯到 14 世紀中葉,收藏大量傑出的雕像和壁畫。"]],"deal with":[["leader-109-28","The clerk couldn't \u0001deal with\u0002 the guest's complaint, so he asked the manager for help to sort out the problem.","店員無法處理客人的抱怨,所以找經理幫忙解決問題。"],["leader-114-6","Time is running out, so we must \u0001deal with\u0002 the problem right away.","時間快用完了,我們必須立刻處理這個問題。"]],"death certificate":[["guide-113-31","In the unfortunate event of a group member's accidental demise during a foreign trip, it is necessary to obtain an official \u0001death certificate\u0002 from local authorities.",""]],"deep conversation":[["leader-114-61","We should avoid approaching two people who are engaged in \u0001deep conversation\u0002.","我們應該避免接近兩個正在深談的人。"]],"departure gate":[["leader-112-5","Could you please tell me where the \u0001departure gate\u0002 is?","可以告訴我登機門在哪裡嗎?"],["guide-111-38","Our plane will take off in twenty minutes, so we'd better hurry to the \u0001departure gate\u0002.","我們的飛機二十分鐘後起飛,所以我們最好趕快到登機門。"]],"depend on":[["guide-106-54","The Maldives \u0001depends on\u0002 tourism as a main source of income; many local people would do their best to cater to the needs of foreign visitors.","馬爾地夫仰賴觀光作為主要收入來源;許多當地人會盡力迎合外國旅客的需求。"]],"depend upon":[["guide-113-5","Caller: How much are your single rooms? Front Desk Clerk: The rates vary \u0001depending upon\u0002 the season and type of single rooms.","來電者:你們的單人房多少錢? 櫃台:價格會依季節與單人房型而有所不同。"]],"diet coke":[["guide-110-30","Flight attendant: Do you want a can, Sir? Passenger: A \u0001diet coke\u0002, please.","空服員:先生,您要罐裝飲料嗎? 乘客:一罐健怡可樂,謝謝。"]],"dine out":[["guide-112-21","In many countries, it is customary to leave a gratuity while \u0001dining out\u0002.","在許多國家,外出用餐時留小費是慣例。"]],"dining hall":[["guide-106-35","Due to the blizzard, all the guests had no choice but to stay in the hotel and eat together in the communal \u0001dining hall\u0002.","因暴風雪,所有客人只能待在飯店,並在公用餐廳一起用餐。"]],"direct flight":[["leader-110-65","Clerk: Okay, I will arrange a \u0001direct flight\u0002 with no stop for you but it will cost more.",""]],"discounted fare":[["leader-114-34","Passengers often get upset due to long lines and confusion about ticket restrictions hidden in the small print of \u0001discounted fares\u0002.","乘客常因長長的隊伍,以及對折扣票價小字裡隱藏的票務限制感到困惑而不悅。"]],"distinguished by":[["guide-115-6","The area above 2000 meters in Taiwan is home to the Formosan black bear, the largest land mammal on the island, and \u0001distinguished by\u0002 a white V-shaped crescent on the chest.","台灣海拔 2000 公尺以上是台灣黑熊的家,牠是島上最大的陸生哺乳動物,以胸前白色 V 形月牙紋為特徵。"]],"dominant hand":[["leader-114-74","Right-handedness or Left-handedness—This might be a smaller consideration for nonbusiness travelers, but if you plan on working from a flight, consider your \u0001dominant hand\u0002.","",4]],"double room":[["leader-108-14","Receptionist: ABC Hotel, may I help you? Justin: Do you have a vacancy for a \u0001double room\u0002 on March First?","櫃台:ABC 飯店,能為您服務嗎? Justin:3 月 1 日有空房的雙人房嗎?"]],"double-edged sword":[["guide-111-71","In a nutshell, tourism is always a \u0001double-edged sword\u0002.","",1],["guide-111-75","Tourism, which only comes with positive impacts, is not a double-edged sword.","觀光只帶來正面影響,並非雙面刃。",3]],"Dragon Boat Festival":[["guide-112-26","The \u0001Dragon Boat Festival\u0002 commemorates Qu-Yuan, an old poet who drowned himself when a ruler ignored his advice.","端午節紀念屈原,一位在君王忽視其忠言後投江自盡的古代詩人。"]],"draw in":[["guide-115-37","These connected walkways act like funnels that \u0001draw in\u0002 breezes in summer.","這些相連的走道像漏斗一樣,在夏天引入微風。"]],"dress code":[["leader-112-9","A: Do you have any \u0001dress code\u0002? B: T-shirts, shorts and slippers are strictly prohibited.","A:你們有服裝規定嗎? B:嚴禁 T 恤、短褲和拖鞋。"],["guide-109-8","In some restaurants, there may be a \u0001dress code\u0002. You cannot just turn up with your shorts and sandals.","有些餐廳有服裝規定,你不能穿短褲拖鞋就直接進去。"]],"dress up":[["leader-112-52","If you plan to go to this upscale restaurant, men and women are required to \u0001dress up\u0002.","如果你打算去這間高檔餐廳,男女都須盛裝打扮。"]],"driver's license":[["guide-109-66","This is a routine stop check. Your \u0001driver's license\u0002 and vehicle registration card, please.","這是例行攔檢。請出示你的駕照和行車執照。"],["guide-111-57","Please remove your \u0001driver's license\u0002 from your wallet and hand me your ID.","請從你的皮夾裡拿出你的駕照並把 ID 給我。"]],"driving force":[["guide-106-4","Because PayPal helps people transact anytime, anywhere and in any way, the company is a \u0001driving force\u0002 behind the growth of mobile commerce.","因為 PayPal 讓人們隨時、隨地、以任何方式交易,該公司成為行動商務成長的推手。"]],"drop off":[["leader-113-75","Unlike the non-stop flight, the plane makes a stop en route to the final destination for refueling and picking up and \u0001dropping off\u0002 passengers.","",4]],"drunk driving":[["guide-112-44","Only when David was stopped by a policeman for \u0001drunk driving\u0002 did he realize that his passport had expired and he was forced to return home.","直到 David 因酒駕被警察攔下,他才意識到護照已過期,並被迫返國。"]],"duffle bag":[["leader-109-4","Clerk: Could you describe to me what your bag looks like? Traveler: It's a black \u0001duffle bag\u0002 with a yellow strap.","人員:能描述一下你的包長什麼樣子嗎? 旅客:是個黑色行李袋配黃色背帶。"]],"duty free":[["leader-110-27","ABC \u0001Duty Free\u0002 is the best place for duty free shopping. The prices are generally better than other duty free places, and it has got a big selection, too.","ABC 免稅店是免稅購物的最佳去處。價格普遍比其他免稅店好,而且品項選擇也很多。"]],"east coast":[["guide-112-29","Much of Taiwan's natural beauty and wealth are conserved on the \u0001east coast\u0002 of the island.","台灣大部分的自然美景與資源都保存在島嶼東海岸。"]],"economy class":[["guide-108-3","Flying in \u0001economy class\u0002 can be crowded and hot.","搭經濟艙可能又擠又熱。"],["guide-110-38","Passenger: What is the baggage allowance? Officer: It is 20 kg for the \u0001economy class\u0002.","乘客:行李限額是多少? 地勤:經濟艙是 20 公斤。"]],"effective from":[["leader-112-25","\u0001Effective from\u0002 October 13, 2022, Taiwan has lifted the quarantine requirement for all arrivals, so arriving travelers will no longer be required to quarantine.","自 2022 年 10 月 13 日起,台灣取消所有入境者的隔離要求,入境旅客不再須隔離。"]],"electronic device":[["guide-107-43","People use their \u0001electronic devices\u0002 while walking. When they do so, it is very difficult to be aware of what is going on around them.","人們邊走邊用電子裝置,這樣一來,很難察覺周遭發生的事。"]],"embedded chip":[["guide-114-58","A biometric passport includes various security features such as \u0001embedded chips\u0002, biometric data, and digital signatures, making it harder to counterfeit.","生物辨識護照包含多種安全特徵,如嵌入式晶片、生物特徵資料與數位簽章,使其更難偽造。"]],"emergency contact":[["leader-114-40","The registration form asks for an \u0001emergency contact\u0002 in case you fall ill during your travels.","報名表要求填寫緊急聯絡人,以防你旅行中生病。"]],"emergency landing":[["leader-114-52","During the \u0001emergency landing\u0002, the flight crew followed the safety protocol to ensure everyone's safety.","緊急降落時,機組人員遵循安全規程以確保所有人的安全。"]],"empty out":[["guide-111-40","Please \u0001empty out\u0002 your pocket. Put your bag, phone and other electronic devices, belt or metal objects on the tray.","請清空你的口袋。把你的包包、手機和其他電子裝置、皮帶或金屬物品放在托盤上。"]],"empty seat":[["guide-113-70","Are there two \u0001empty seats\u0002 next to each other?",""]],"en route":[["leader-113-71","Unlike the non-stop flight, the plane makes a stop \u0001en route\u0002 to the final destination for refueling and picking up and dropping off passengers.","",1],["leader-113-71","It may have a stop en route to the final destination.","途中可能停一站。",3]],"endangered species":[["leader-110-71","Choosing locally made souvenirs is another area where the tourist can be either a help or a hindrance, but never buy anything made from an \u0001endangered species\u0002.","",1]],"engaged in":[["leader-114-61","We should avoid approaching two people who are \u0001engaged in\u0002 deep conversation.","我們應該避免接近兩個正在深談的人。"]],"entry requirements":[["leader-115-64","It is common sense that before booking your international flight, you should always check the validity of your passport to ensure it meets the \u0001entry requirements\u0002 for your destination country.","常識是,預訂國際航班前,你應該先檢查護照的有效性(效期),以確保符合目的地國的入境要求。"]],"environmental protection":[["leader-113-5","Customer: May I have two plastic forks, please? Receptionist: Unfortunately, we no longer provide any disposable utensils due to the new \u0001environmental protection\u0002 act.","顧客:可以給我兩支塑膠叉子嗎? 櫃台:抱歉,因新環保法我們不再提供任何拋棄式餐具。"]],"environmentally friendly":[["leader-113-40","Compared to taking a taxi or renting a car, public transportation is more economical and \u0001environmentally friendly\u0002.","相較於搭計程車或租車,大眾運輸更經濟實惠且環保。"]],"even if":[["guide-113-51","The manager tried very hard to squeeze us in for a delightful dinner \u0001even if\u0002 the restaurant was fully booked, showing exceptional customer service.","儘管餐廳已客滿,經理仍非常努力地把我們擠進去享用愉快的晚餐,展現了卓越的顧客服務。"]],"even so":[["guide-107-27","Hualien is a small city, but \u0001even so\u0002, it attracts many tourists.","花蓮是座小城市,但即使如此,仍吸引許多觀光客。"]],"even though":[["guide-106-20","A newborn kangaroo can find its mother's pouch \u0001even though\u0002 its eyes are not yet open.","剛出生的袋鼠即使眼睛還沒睜開,也能找到媽媽的育兒袋。"]],"evil spirit":[["leader-107-47","While many people avoid garlic in their food for fear of smelling of it, Romanians have a cult-like appreciation for the plant. It is thought that garlic can protect people and homes from \u0001evil spirits\u0002.","許多人怕食物沾上蒜味而避吃大蒜,羅馬尼亞人卻對這植物有近乎狂熱的推崇。據信大蒜能保護人與家園免受惡靈侵擾。"]],"excess baggage":[["leader-108-13","If your baggage exceeds the free checked piece and weight allowance, \u0001excess baggage\u0002 charges will be applied.","如果你的行李超過免費託運件數和重量額度,將收取超重行李費。"],["leader-110-5","You'll need to pay for an \u0001excess baggage\u0002 fee.",""]],"excess fare":[["guide-112-67","Attendant: Oh, I'm afraid your bag has exceeded the maximum baggage allowance, so you'll have to pay the \u0001excess fare\u0002.",""]],"exchange currency":[["guide-115-25","Travelers can \u0001exchange currency\u0002 upon arrival in Taiwan, or even before departing for their trip, to avoid ATM service fees and higher exchange rate conversion costs.","旅客可在抵達台灣時換匯,或甚至在出發前就換,以避免 ATM 手續費與較高的匯率兌換成本。"]],"exchange rate":[["leader-109-21","Customer: What is the \u0001exchange rate\u0002 for Indian rupee? Clerk: One Indian rupee is worth about 1.5 Japanese yen today.","顧客:印度盧比的匯率是多少? 櫃台:今天一印度盧比約值 1.5 日圓。"],["leader-110-63","What's the \u0001exchange rate\u0002 for US dollar? I have heard that it's a good time to buy US dollar.","美金的匯率是多少?我聽說現在是買美金的好時機。"]],"exercise facilities":[["leader-110-41","Lisa: Do you have any \u0001exercise facilities\u0002? Hotel clerk: You can go to the 15th floor where our gym is and as long as you have running shoes with you, you can use all of our equipment with no extra charge.","Lisa:你們有健身設施嗎? 櫃台:可以到 15 樓的健身房,只要隨身帶著跑鞋,所有器材都能免費使用。"]],"expiration date":[["leader-115-29","Passenger: How long is my ticket good for? Station staff: It's good until the \u0001expiration date\u0002 written on the ticket.","乘客:我的票有效到什麼時候? 站務員:到票上寫的到期日為止。"]],"extended family":[["guide-115-34","In the past, a patriarchal \u0001extended family\u0002 including grandparents, uncles, aunts, parents and children was the traditional pattern for people.","過去,包含祖父母、叔伯姑姨、父母與子女的大(擴展)父系家庭,是人們傳統的家庭型態。"]],"extra charge":[["leader-114-44","Roger: What time do we need to check out of the hotel tomorrow? Alice: We should do it before 11 a.m. to avoid \u0001extra charges\u0002.","Roger:我們明天幾點要退房? Alice:應該在上午 11 點前,以免額外收費。"]],"facial expression":[["guide-107-12","Most people interact using both verbal and nonverbal communications, so paying attention to \u0001facial expressions\u0002 can help you read a situation.","多數人互動時會運用語言與非語言溝通,所以留意臉部表情能幫你讀懂情況。"]],"facial recognition":[["leader-113-59","\u0001Facial recognition\u0002 technology is being increasingly utilized in airport passenger screening in the USA to enhance security measures and expedite passenger verification processes.","臉部辨識技術在美國機場旅客安檢中日益普及,以強化安全並加速旅客身分查驗。"]],"fall ill":[["leader-114-40","The registration form asks for an emergency contact in case you \u0001fall ill\u0002 during your travels.","報名表要求填寫緊急聯絡人,以防你旅行中生病。"]],"fall over":[["leader-110-1","Guest: My friend has just \u0001fallen over\u0002 and cut his leg badly.",""]],"fall prey to":[["guide-111-21","Many tourists can easily \u0001fall prey to\u0002 the pickpockets in some crowded tourist spots.","在一些擁擠的景點,許多遊客很容易成為扒手的獵物(受害者)。"]],"falling rocks":[["leader-113-1","Visitors of the national park should beware of \u0001falling rocks\u0002 on the road and trails, especially after heavy rains, typhoons and earthquakes.","國家公園遊客應當心路上和步道的落石,尤其在大雨、颱風和地震後。"]],"family connection":[["guide-112-23","Ancestry tourism is a sort of tourism in which tourists visit locations where they may learn family history and develop \u0001family connections\u0002.","尋根(族譜)旅遊是一種旅遊,遊客造訪某些地點,以了解家族歷史、建立家族連結。"]],"famous for":[["guide-111-70","Taiwan is \u0001famous for\u0002 its rich fruit supply.","台灣以豐富的水果供應聞名。"]],"far and away":[["leader-114-5","\u0001Far and away\u0002 the best prize that life offers is the chance to work hard at work worth doing.","人生給的最好獎賞,遠遠是有機會為值得做的工作努力。"]],"far apart":[["leader-107-77","Japanese people tend to stand far apart from each other.","日本人傾向彼此站得遠。",3]],"fast food":[["guide-108-60","Meals from \u0001fast food\u0002 restaurants may be the easiest and cheapest alternatives for a traveler.","速食店的餐點也許是旅客最方便又最便宜的選擇。"]],"fast pace":[["guide-107-77","Fast pace","快步調",3]],"fasten seat belt":[["guide-112-11","You must remain seated while the \u0001fasten-seat-belt\u0002 signals are illuminated during turbulence.","亂流期間,當繫安全帶指示燈亮起時,你必須保持坐好。"]],"fed up":[["leader-106-8","A: I'm so \u0001fed up\u0002!",""]],"fed up with":[["leader-115-43","\u0001Fed up with\u0002 the noise from the hallway, the couple decided to call the front desk and file a formal complaint.","受夠了走廊的噪音,這對夫妻決定打電話到櫃台正式投訴。"]],"feel free to":[["guide-112-10","Should you have any questions regarding the loss of your wallet and passport abroad, \u0001feel free to\u0002 contact us anytime during office hours.","若你在國外有任何關於錢包和護照遺失的問題,歡迎在辦公時間隨時與我們聯繫。"]],"feel like":[["guide-111-43","Do you \u0001feel like\u0002 having a cup of hot tea?","你想喝杯熱茶嗎?"]],"feel well":[["guide-112-60","Janet: I haven't been \u0001feeling well\u0002 since I joined a tour group last Monday.",""]],"fill in":[["guide-112-4","Foreigners without an ROC (Taiwan) Resident Certificate are required to \u0001fill in\u0002 an Arrival Card.","沒有中華民國(台灣)居留證的外國人須填寫入境登記卡。"]],"fill out":[["leader-112-18","Passengers arriving in Taiwan must \u0001fill out\u0002 a health declaration form.","抵達台灣的旅客須填寫健康申報表。"],["leader-114-47","Wilson: Before we leave for the trip, can you \u0001fill out\u0002 this questionnaire about your preferences?",""]],"final boarding call":[["leader-110-44","Clerk: This is the \u0001final boarding call\u0002 for John and Mary Smith booked on flight 321C to Salt Lake City. Please proceed to gate 3 immediately.","地勤:這是已訂位飛往鹽湖城 321C 班機的 John 和 Mary Smith 最後登機廣播,請立刻前往 3 號登機門。"]],"final destination":[["leader-113-71","Unlike the non-stop flight, the plane makes a stop en route to the \u0001final destination\u0002 for refueling and picking up and dropping off passengers.","",4]],"financial aid":[["guide-110-43","In response to the current virus pandemic, the Tourism Bureau is providing \u0001financial aid\u0002 to city and county governments to encourage hotels to participate in the “Quarantine Hotels” program.","為因應當前疫情,交通部觀光局提供財務補助給縣市政府,鼓勵飯店參加「防疫(隔離)旅館」計畫。"]],"financial loss":[["leader-111-80","Closing Business to Avoid Financial Loss","歇業以避免虧損",2]],"fire alarm":[["guide-108-8","Smoke detector is an electronic \u0001fire alarm\u0002 that is sensitive to smoke.","煙霧偵測器是一種對煙敏感的電子火災警報器。"]],"first aid":[["leader-110-1","Clerk: Someone will get the \u0001first aid\u0002 equipment and come straight up.",""]],"first aid kit":[["leader-114-48","Vicky: Did you remember to pack the \u0001first aid kit\u0002 for our hiking trip?",""]],"first class":[["guide-108-5","\u0001First class\u0002 passengers can enjoy gourmet food.","頭等艙旅客可享用美饌。"]],"fishing boat":[["leader-108-33","The local residents suggest us to try cruising around the Greek islands in a traditional \u0001fishing boat\u0002.","當地居民建議我們試試搭傳統漁船航行希臘群島。"]],"fitness center":[["guide-110-55","Use of the \u0001fitness center\u0002 is restricted to in-house guests and members only.","健身中心僅限館內(住宿)賓客與會員使用。"],["guide-113-23","Guest: Where is the \u0001fitness center\u0002?",""]],"fitting room":[["leader-112-61","The \u0001fitting room\u0002 is right there.",""],["guide-109-30","When shopping for clothing, you can try the items on in \u0001fitting rooms\u0002 before buying them.","買衣服時,你可以在試衣間試穿再決定買。"]],"flash photography":[["guide-109-15","Inside the museum, \u0001flash photography\u0002 is strictly prohibited.","在博物館內,嚴格禁止使用閃光燈拍照。"]],"flight attendant":[["leader-110-46","\u0001Flight attendants\u0002 can help travelers with young kids to board earlier for their convenience.","空服員可協助帶幼童的旅客提早登機,以方便他們。"],["leader-112-1","\u0001Flight attendant\u0002: Sir, please switch off your mobile phone as we are about to takeoff.","空服員:先生,我們即將起飛,請關閉手機。"]],"flight crew":[["leader-114-52","During the emergency landing, the \u0001flight crew\u0002 followed the safety protocol to ensure everyone's safety.","緊急降落時,機組人員遵循安全規程以確保所有人的安全。"]],"flight mode":[["leader-113-61","All mobile phones must be switched to \u0001flight mode\u0002 before takeoff and landing.","所有手機在起飛和降落前必須切換到飛航模式。"]],"flight number":[["leader-113-73","In a direct flight, you do not change planes and you have only one \u0001flight number\u0002.","",4]],"flight path":[["leader-114-71","Potential Views—If you prefer a window seat, you might want to check your potential \u0001flight path\u0002 before picking a side.","",1]],"flight ticket":[["leader-113-7","As soon as your traveling date is fixed, you need to book yourself a \u0001flight ticket\u0002 and make your hotel reservations.","旅行日期一確定,你就得訂機票和訂飯店。"]],"fly to":[["guide-110-35","I will \u0001fly to\u0002 Rome from London on the 24th of January 1.","我會在1 月 24 日從倫敦飛往羅馬。"]],"flyer miles":[["leader-109-15","Janet uses her frequent \u0001flyer miles\u0002 to get a free flight from Tokyo to Taipei.","Janet 用她的常客飛行哩程換一趟東京到台北的免費航班。"]],"folk music":[["guide-108-34","Launched in 2017, a new government sponsored TV station provides a variety of indigenous programming on \u0001folk music\u0002, dance, handicraft, and so on.","2017 年開播、由政府贊助的新電視台,提供多樣的原住民節目,包含民族音樂、舞蹈、手工藝等。"]],"folk performance":[["guide-108-42","To celebrate traditional festivals, various activities are held in streets and in temples. Firecrackers are set off and people go out to enjoy the \u0001folk performances\u0002.","為慶祝傳統節慶,街上與廟宇舉辦各種活動。燃放鞭炮,人們出門欣賞民俗表演。"]],"folk ritual":[["guide-110-70","The burning of the Plague God Boat is a \u0001folk ritual\u0002 practiced by fishermen in southwestern Taiwan.","燒王船是台灣西南部漁民奉行的民俗儀式。"]],"fond memories":[["guide-107-78","Fond memories","美好回憶",3]],"food delivery":[["leader-112-34","The online \u0001food delivery\u0002 industry has a special relationship with users in a three-way structure that includes consumers, restaurants, and couriers.","線上外送產業與用戶形成三方結構,包含消費者、餐廳和外送員。"]],"food stall":[["guide-114-31","Restaurants and \u0001food stalls\u0002 fill the roads in any built-up area.",""]],"food tourism":[["guide-110-29","In recent years, \u0001food tourism\u0002 has been defined by a single phrase: “Eat like a local.”","近年來,美食旅遊被一句話定義:「像當地人一樣吃。」"]],"food wrapper":[["leader-109-76","Many of these products, such as plastic bags and \u0001food wrappers\u0002, have a lifespan of mere minutes to hours, yet they may persist in the environment for hundreds of years.","",4]],"for a night":[["guide-107-37","A: Are you going to drive all the way to Taitung? B: No, we'll stop by in Kaohsiung \u0001for a night\u0002.","A:你要一路開車到台東嗎? B:不,我們會在高雄過一夜。"]],"foreign exchange":[["leader-111-29","Guest: Do you charge handling fee for \u0001foreign exchange\u0002?",""]],"forest railway":[["guide-115-33","The Alishan \u0001Forest Railway\u0002 is a treasure of Taiwan. Every day, the train takes passengers on wonderful rides forward through different forest types.","阿里山森林鐵路是台灣的瑰寶。每天,火車載著旅客穿越不同森林類型,展開美妙的旅程。"]],"forest resource":[["guide-107-19","The \u0001forest resource\u0002 in Taiwan adds up to around 58 percent of the size of the island.","台灣的森林資源加總約達全島面積的 58%。"]],"fossil fuel":[["guide-112-71","They will offer \u0001fossil fuel\u0002-free domestic flights by 2026.","",1]],"free flight":[["leader-109-15","Janet uses her frequent flyer miles to get a \u0001free flight\u0002 from Tokyo to Taipei.","Janet 用她的常客飛行哩程換一趟東京到台北的免費航班。"]],"free of charge":[["leader-110-11","Front desk: Local calls and room to room calls are \u0001free of charge\u0002.",""],["guide-109-28","Usually the hotel offers guests two bottles of drinking water \u0001free of charge\u0002. They are complimentary.","飯店通常免費提供客人兩瓶飲用水,它們是免費招待的。"]],"French fries":[["leader-112-35","Waiter: What would you like to have for your side dish? John: I'll have \u0001French fries\u0002.","服務生:您的配菜想要什麼? John:我要薯條。"]],"fresh air":[["leader-109-11","Some passengers felt seasick, so they went up on the deck for some \u0001fresh air\u0002.","有些乘客暈船,所以到甲板上透透氣。"]],"fried rice":[["leader-110-32","I would like a seafood \u0001fried rice\u0002. Please make it to takeaway.","我要一份海鮮炒飯,請做成外帶。"]],"front desk":[["leader-107-41","Tom calls the \u0001front desk\u0002: How to set the combination for the safe in my room? I would like to leave my computer in the safe while I'm going out.","Tom 打給櫃台:房間保險箱的密碼組合怎麼設?我出門時想把電腦放保險箱。"],["leader-109-40","\u0001Front desk\u0002 clerk: What seems to be the problem with your invoice? Hotel Guest: I think I have been overcharged.","櫃台:你的帳單有什麼問題嗎? 飯店客人:我覺得我被多收費了。"]],"front desk clerk":[["leader-113-56","\u0001Front Desk Clerk\u0002: I'm sorry to hear that.",""]],"frying pan":[["leader-108-34","Mary bought her parents a new set of kitchen utensils including bowls, knives, and \u0001frying pans\u0002.","Mary 買了一組新的廚房用具給父母,包括碗、刀和平底鍋。"]],"fuel price":[["leader-113-10","Airlines will hike their international airfares by an average of 4.5% on Nov. 30 due to rising \u0001fuel prices\u0002.","由於燃油價格上漲,航空公司將於 11 月 30 日將國際票價平均調漲 4.5%。"]],"fully booked":[["guide-113-51","The manager tried very hard to squeeze us in for a delightful dinner even if the restaurant was \u0001fully booked\u0002, showing exceptional customer service.","儘管餐廳已客滿,經理仍非常努力地把我們擠進去享用愉快的晚餐,展現了卓越的顧客服務。"]],"furry friends":[["leader-113-32","\u0001Furry friends\u0002 are welcome at our hotel. Add a pet to your reservation for $75 per stay.","我們飯店歡迎毛小孩。每次入住加 75 元即可為訂房加購寵物入住。"]],"gas station":[["leader-111-36","Tour leader: You can probably find one at a \u0001gas station\u0002 or a convenience store.",""]],"gas tank":[["guide-113-41","Don't forget to fill the \u0001gas tank\u0002 before returning the car. This will save you extra fuel and service fees.","還車前別忘了把油箱加滿。這能為你省下額外的油費與服務費。"]],"genetically modified":[["leader-106-64","Plans to label \u0001genetically modified\u0002 foods has led to conflict between the food industry and the government.","為基改食品標示的計畫,導致食品業與政府之間的衝突。"]],"get a glimpse of":[["leader-115-59","When our group visited a church this morning, we \u0001got a glimpse of\u0002 how the priest performed a local ritual.","今早我們團體參觀一間教堂時,得以一瞥神父如何進行當地的儀式。"]],"get along with":[["leader-114-7","I \u0001get along with\u0002 my coworkers quite well. We often collaborate on projects and enjoy spending time together during breaks.","我跟同事相處得很好。我們常一起合作專案,休息時也喜歡待在一起。"]],"get around":[["leader-107-30","If you've chosen a self-catering holiday, you'll probably have to \u0001get around\u0002 on your own using taxis, buses, subways - or the tube if you're traveling to London.","如果你選了自理式假期,你大概得靠自己搭計程車、公車、地鐵四處移動——去倫敦的話則是搭地鐵(the tube)。"],["leader-108-16","The open-top tour buses in London can be fun, but are pretty pricey way to \u0001get around\u0002.","倫敦的敞篷觀光巴士很好玩,但是貴的交通方式。"]],"get into":[["leader-111-33","Tourist: I've lost my key and I need to \u0001get into\u0002 my room. Can I get a replacement?","遊客:我把鑰匙弄丟了,得進房間。我能拿一把備用(替換)鑰匙嗎?"]],"get lost":[["guide-111-62","Take a map with you in case you \u0001get lost\u0002.","帶張地圖在身上,以防迷路。"]],"get on":[["guide-106-21","As soon as the other passengers \u0001get on\u0002 the bus, we'll leave.","其他乘客一…就上車,我們就出發。"]],"get over":[["leader-114-17","getting over","克服",2]],"get some rest":[["guide-115-23","B: I was feeling a bit under the weather, so I stayed home to \u0001get some rest\u0002.",""]],"get there":[["guide-107-39","I didn't know what time the bus would \u0001get there\u0002.","我不知道公車幾點會到那裡。"]],"get to":[["leader-109-12","Hotel Guest: Could you tell me how to \u0001get to\u0002 the concert hall? Clerk: Yes, just go outside the hotel and turn left.","飯店客人:能告訴我怎麼去音樂廳嗎? 櫃台:可以,出飯店左轉就到。"],["guide-107-29","How can we \u0001get to\u0002 the Museum from here?",""]],"get used to":[["leader-114-17","getting used to","習慣",2],["guide-111-35","People from Australia, where the air is usually dry, have a tough time \u0001getting used to\u0002 the humid weather in Taiwan.","來自空氣通常乾燥的澳洲的人,很難適應台灣潮濕的天氣。"]],"get vaccinated":[["leader-114-67","People who haven't previously contracted the virus are advised to \u0001get vaccinated\u0002 at least four weeks before the travel.","先前沒有感染過病毒的人,被建議在旅行前至少四週接種疫苗。"]],"Ghost Month":[["guide-108-45","Some people think it is superstitious, but many people believe that the doors of the underworld open once a year during Chinese \u0001Ghost Month\u0002.","有些人認為那是迷信,但許多人相信農曆鬼月每年一次陰間之門會開啟。"]],"give up":[["guide-107-24","Many people have tried to \u0001give up\u0002 bad habits at some point in their lives.","許多人一生中某個時刻都試過戒除壞習慣。"]],"global warming":[["guide-106-76","There are still a few people in northern Europe who think that \u0001global warming\u0002 might not be such a bad thing.","",1],["guide-106-76","To provide evidence for global warming","為全球暖化提供證據",2]],"glove puppetry":[["guide-107-59","One of the most famous traditional arts in Taiwan is \u0001glove puppetry\u0002. Professional performers use their hands and voices to bring the puppets to life.","台灣最著名的傳統藝術之一是布袋戲。專業演師用雙手與聲音賦予戲偶生命。"],["guide-109-37","\u0001Glove puppetry\u0002 is Taiwan's cultural treasure that we should respect and cherish.","布袋戲是台灣的文化瑰寶,我們應該尊重並珍惜它。"]],"glutinous rice":[["guide-110-64","Mochi or muah chee is a sweet and chewy dessert made of \u0001glutinous rice\u0002.","麻糬是一種用糯米製成、香甜有嚼勁的甜點。"]],"go a long way":[["leader-107-26","A simple \"Please,\" \"Thank you,\" and \"I'm sorry\" in the local language \u0001goes a long way\u0002 when you are on a trip.","旅途中,用當地語言簡單說聲「請」「謝謝」「對不起」很有幫助(受用無窮)。"]],"go around":[["guide-113-37","Riding a scooter is one of the best ways to explore Taiwan. On the offshore islands, \u0001going around\u0002 by scooter is practically essential.","騎機車是探索台灣最好的方式之一。在離島以機車代步幾乎是必要的。"]],"go down":[["guide-109-48","A: Hi, do you know where the nearest subway station is? B: \u0001Go down\u0002 this street, turn left, and you should see it on your right.","A:嗨,你知道最近的地鐵站在哪嗎? B:沿這條街走,左轉,就會在你右手邊看到。"]],"go Dutch":[["guide-109-24","One simplest way to mean splitting the bill can be “\u0001Go Dutch\u0002.”","表達「分攤帳單」最簡單的一種說法是「各付各的」。"]],"go hand in hand":[["guide-109-71","For many, love and chocolate \u0001go hand in hand\u0002, so a visit to the Chocolate Museum in Cologne, Germany, makes sense.","",1]],"go hiking":[["guide-107-36","A: What do you do in your spare time? B: I \u0001go hiking\u0002 with friends.","A:你空閒時都做什麼? B:我會和朋友去健行。"]],"go on":[["guide-107-43","People use their electronic devices while walking. When they do so, it is very difficult to be aware of what is \u0001going on\u0002 around them.","人們邊走邊用電子裝置,這樣一來,很難察覺周遭發生的事。"]],"go out of business":[["leader-107-17","Firms that are less productive will \u0001go out of business\u0002. This creates an incentive for firms to be as productive as possible.","生產力較低的公司會倒閉。這給了公司盡可能提高生產力的誘因。"]],"go shopping":[["guide-108-9","Let's \u0001go shopping\u0002 at the Hilton hotel boutique.","我們去希爾頓飯店的精品店逛逛吧。"]],"go straight":[["leader-114-35","When you leave the hotel, turn left and \u0001go straight\u0002 for two blocks until you get to the intersection.",""]],"go through":[["guide-112-40","If passengers have anything that needs to be declared, they should \u0001go through\u0002 Customs.","若旅客有任何需要申報的物品,應走海關。"]],"go to":[["leader-112-42","Excuse me, which terminal should I \u0001go to\u0002 for the connecting flight to Chicago?","不好意思,轉機到芝加哥要去哪個航廈?"]],"go well with":[["leader-111-7","Guest: Would the white wine \u0001go well with\u0002 my meal? Waiter: Yes, the wine should complement it nicely.","客人:白酒配我的餐點好嗎? 服務生:好的,這酒能很好地襯托它。"],["leader-112-29","A: Shall we order a bottle of the house red? B: Yes, today's Pinot Noir \u0001goes well with\u0002 steaks.","A:我們要不要點瓶招牌紅酒? B:好,今天的黑皮諾很配牛排。"]],"gold mining town":[["guide-108-18","After taking in the rock formations of the Northeast Coast, it's time to head to the legendary \u0001gold mining town\u0002 of Jinguashi.","欣賞完東北角的岩石地形後,該前往傳奇的金瓜石採金小鎮了。"]],"gold panning":[["guide-115-2","Thousands of people flocked to the Keelung River area to try their luck at \u0001gold panning\u0002.","成千上萬的人湧向基隆河一帶,想碰碰運氣淘金。"]],"good fortune":[["guide-107-64","The Hakka town of Meinong in southern Taiwan is famous for its oil paper umbrellas, which not only provide shelter from the sun but also symbolize \u0001good fortune\u0002.","台灣南部的客家小鎮美濃以其油紙傘聞名,不僅能遮陽,也象徵好運。"]],"Green Channel":[["leader-115-27","If you have nothing to declare, simply walk through the \u0001Green Channel\u0002, stopping only if asked to do so by a customs agent.","如果你沒有任何東西要申報,就直接走綠線通道,除非海關人員要求你停下。"]],"green consumer":[["leader-112-71","\u0001Green consumers\u0002 are those who are aware of and interested in environmental issues.","",1]],"greenhouse gas":[["guide-106-79","Due to rising emissions of \u0001greenhouse gases\u0002, such as carbon dioxide from the combustion of fossil fuels, this ice sheet is melting at an alarming rate.","",4]],"grocery store":[["leader-106-55","If you collect seven coupons from the \u0001grocery store\u0002, you can get a free mug.","如果你從雜貨店集滿七張優惠券,就能換一個免費馬克杯。"]],"ground staff":[["leader-112-41","Besides your passport, the \u0001ground staff\u0002 also needs to check your COVID-19 vaccination card during the check-in.","除了護照,地勤在報到時也需查驗你的 COVID-19 疫苗接種卡。"],["guide-106-46","Not knowing when the flight was going to take off, some tourists had lost their patience and started yelling at the \u0001ground staff\u0002.","不知班機何時起飛,有些旅客失去耐心,開始對地勤大吼。"]],"group member":[["guide-112-52","B: We have been waiting in the baggage claim area for one and a half hours, but some of our \u0001group members\u0002 still can't find their luggage.",""]],"group photo":[["leader-112-57","Everyone can come to this corner. Based on my experience, it is the best view to take a selfie or a \u0001group photo\u0002.","大家都可以到這個角落。以我經驗,這是拍自拍或團體照最佳的取景點。"]],"guest room":[["guide-110-56","A complimentary room is a \u0001guest room\u0002 for which no charge is made.","免費招待房是不收費的客房。"]],"guide book":[["leader-106-3","Unlike local people, you'll carry \u0001guide books\u0002, refer to maps, take photos and look up at buildings.","不像當地人,你會帶著旅遊書、查閱地圖、拍照、抬頭看建築。"]],"guide sign":[["guide-110-51","\u0001Guide signs\u0002 are installed to direct disabled passengers to the trains.","車站裝設了引導標誌,以引導身障旅客前往列車。"]],"guided tour":[["leader-111-11","Receptionist: Our one-day package tour includes a \u0001guided tour\u0002 of the city and free transportation. Guest: That sounds perfect.","櫃台:我們的一日套裝行程含城市導覽和免費接送(交通)。 客人:聽起來很完美。"]],"Gulf Stream":[["guide-106-76","The link in the chain of events is what some call the \u0001Gulf Stream\u0002 and others call the Atlantic Conveyor.","",1],["guide-106-79","Because the Gulf Stream will stop carrying warmer water to Britain","因為墨西哥灣流將停止把暖水送到英國",3]],"hand luggage":[["leader-112-36","\u0001Hand luggage\u0002 carried aboard aircraft by passengers must be within the following dimensions: length 56 cm, width 36 cm, height 23 cm.","乘客帶上機的手提行李須在下列尺寸內:長 56 公分、寬 36 公分、高 23 公分。"],["guide-113-34","Airport security rules state that passengers can only bring liquid items no larger than 100ml in their \u0001hand luggage\u0002.","機場安檢規定,旅客手提行李中只能攜帶不超過 100 毫升的液體物品。"]],"handling fee":[["leader-111-29","Guest: Do you charge \u0001handling fee\u0002 for foreign exchange?",""]],"hang gliding":[["guide-108-65","Brilliant sunshine, strong wind, and sapphire oceans create an ideal environment for a variety of water activities, except \u0001hang gliding\u0002.","燦爛陽光、強風與寶藍海洋,為各種水上活動創造理想環境,唯獨飛行傘除外。"]],"hang out":[["leader-112-54","It is relaxing to sit in this café and \u0001hang out\u0002 with my friends a bit. We can enjoy the riverside view and have a chat.","坐在這咖啡館和朋友閒晃一下很放鬆。可以欣賞河景、聊聊天。"]],"have a chat":[["leader-112-54","It is relaxing to sit in this café and hang out with my friends a bit. We can enjoy the riverside view and \u0001have a chat\u0002.","坐在這咖啡館和朋友閒晃一下很放鬆。可以欣賞河景、聊聊天。"]],"head down":[["leader-113-38","You need to \u0001head down\u0002 this street, and it's just a few blocks that way.",""]],"health care":[["guide-108-75","Over the history of the development of therapeutic spas, hot springs have been regarded as a valuable resource for preventive \u0001health care\u0002 in many countries.","",4]],"health care provider":[["guide-110-5","During the COVID-19 pandemic, travelers should remember to share their previous travel history with their \u0001health care providers\u0002 and make every effort to inform them by phone before visiting a medical facility.","疫情期間,旅客應記得與醫療人員分享先前的旅遊史,並在就醫前盡力以電話通知他們。"]],"health promotion":[["guide-108-75","Meanwhile, European countries considered hot spring resorts as a place for \u0001health promotion\u0002 and disease rehabilitation.","",4]],"health tourism":[["guide-114-47","Today, \u0001health tourism\u0002 is seen as one of the indispensable service areas for elderly consumers.","如今,健康旅遊被視為對銀髮消費者不可或缺的服務領域之一。"]],"hear from":[["guide-115-24","Are you still waiting to \u0001hear from\u0002 your travel agent? Why don't you call him?","你還在等旅行社回覆消息嗎?何不打電話給他?"]],"heavy coat":[["leader-110-68","The weather is going to be really hot and sunny, so I don't think you should take a \u0001heavy coat\u0002 on your trip.","天氣會很炎熱晴朗,所以我認為你旅行不該帶厚外套。"]],"heavy traffic":[["leader-109-65","Linda: The tour we booked begins in ten minutes, but there's no way we'll get there in time with such \u0001heavy traffic\u0002.",""]],"help yourself":[["leader-110-54","Please \u0001help yourself\u0002.",""]],"here you are":[["leader-113-15","Tourist: Yes, \u0001here you are\u0002.",""]],"here you go":[["leader-110-49","Traveler: May I have a local map? Receptionist: Sure, \u0001here you go\u0002.","旅客:能給我一張當地地圖嗎? 櫃台:當然,拿去吧。"]],"hidden away":[["guide-110-24","A beautiful wild hot spring in Taiwan's east, Lisong is \u0001hidden away\u0002 in Taitung's mountains.","栗松是台灣東部一處美麗的野溪溫泉,隱藏在台東的群山之中。"]],"hidden door":[["leader-113-30","The purpose of a \u0001hidden door\u0002 is for security; it is often used to conceal a safe room or valuables.","隱藏門的目的是安全;它常用來隱藏密室或貴重物品。"]],"high end":[["guide-106-75","What does the phrase “a \u0001high end\u0002, 100% custom road and mountain bike (and hike) tour operator” mean?","「高端、100% 客製化的公路與登山車(及健行)旅遊業者」這句話是什麼意思?"]],"high fever":[["leader-111-61","I have a \u0001high fever\u0002 and feel terrible now.",""]],"High Speed Rail":[["guide-114-62","Ladies and Gentlemen, welcome to Taiwan \u0001High Speed Rail\u0002.",""]],"high tide":[["guide-113-10","The city was struck by an exceptional \u0001high tide\u0002, which caused severe flood damage to bridges and roadways.","這座城市遭異常大潮侵襲,造成橋樑與道路嚴重的水患損害。"]],"High-Speed Rail":[["guide-115-19","If your goal is to catch an early \u0001High-Speed Rail\u0002 (HSR) train to Taichung, the 6:00 A.M. MRT is the earliest viable option from the airport.","如果你的目標是搭早班高鐵到台中,清晨 6 點的捷運是從機場出發最早、可行的選擇。"]],"hipped roof":[["guide-113-71","The complex sports a classical \u0001hipped roof\u0002 with double-eave style.","",1]],"historical site":[["leader-112-59","It is easy to find this popular \u0001historical site\u0002.",""],["guide-107-63","This \u0001historical site\u0002 was largely rebuilt between the years of 1990 and 1995.","這處古蹟大部分是在 1990 到 1995 年之間重建的。"]],"hollow out":[["guide-115-7","A night market specialty of Tainan Anping Old Street, the coffin bread consists of a thick hunk of fried bread \u0001hollowed out\u0002 and filled with a creamy chicken, seafood, or vegetable chowder.","台南安平老街的夜市名產「棺材板」,是把一塊厚炸麵包挖空,再填入濃郁的雞肉、海鮮或蔬菜濃湯。"]],"hot pot":[["guide-115-59","A \u0001hot pot\u0002 meal includes a table-side pan of boiling soup where you can dip meat and vegetables in to cook before you eat.","火鍋餐會有一鍋桌邊沸騰的湯,你可以把肉和蔬菜涮(浸)進去煮熟再吃。"]],"hot spot":[["guide-114-29","Alishan Forest Railway is a \u0001hot spot\u0002 in Chiayi County.",""]],"hot spring":[["guide-107-17","The \u0001hot springs\u0002 at Guanziling are located on the side of Zhentou Mountain, and their water is abundant in minerals.","關子嶺的溫泉位於枕頭山側,泉水富含礦物質。"],["guide-110-24","A beautiful wild \u0001hot spring\u0002 in Taiwan's east, Lisong is hidden away in Taitung's mountains.","栗松是台灣東部一處美麗的野溪溫泉,隱藏在台東的群山之中。"]],"hot tub":[["leader-106-67","In the five-star resort with hot spring, the maximum capacity in the \u0001hot tub\u0002 is ten people during the night time.","在這間附溫泉的五星度假村,夜間熱水池的最大容納量是十人。"]],"hot water":[["leader-109-43","There is no \u0001hot water\u0002 in my room; please contact maintenance and ask them to send someone up.","我房間沒熱水,請聯絡維修部,請他們派人上來。"]],"house red":[["leader-112-29","A: Shall we order a bottle of the \u0001house red\u0002? B: Yes, today's Pinot Noir goes well with steaks.","A:我們要不要點瓶招牌紅酒? B:好,今天的黑皮諾很配牛排。"]],"How far":[["guide-111-69","A: \u0001How far\u0002 is the taxi stand nearby?",""]],"How fast":[["guide-110-34","\u0001How fast\u0002 can his car accelerate?","他的車能加速到多快?"]],"how long":[["guide-107-32","A: \u0001How long\u0002 does it take to walk through the National Palace Museum? B: Around four hours.","A:走完故宮要多久? B:大約四小時。"],["guide-109-69","Customs officer: \u0001How long\u0002 will you be staying? Tourist: A week.","海關人員:你會停留多久? 旅客:一週。"]],"how often":[["guide-109-3","Visitor: \u0001How often\u0002 does the bus run from here to the airport? Receptionist: Every 20 minutes.","旅客:這裡到機場的公車多久一班? 櫃台:每 20 分鐘一班。"]],"hustle and bustle":[["guide-113-43","We decided to escape the city's \u0001hustle and bustle\u0002 by booking a luxurious beachfront resort.","我們決定訂一間豪華的海濱度假村,逃離城市的喧囂。"]],"ice age":[["guide-106-76","The latest predictions are that northern Europe could even be plunged into an \u0001ice age\u0002.","",4]],"ice sheet":[["guide-106-76","The reason for this concerns the Greenland \u0001ice sheet\u0002.","",1],["guide-106-79","Because the melted ice from the Greenland ice sheet will flow south to Britain","因為格陵蘭冰蓋融水會南流至英國",2]],"immigration card":[["guide-109-59","May I have \u0001immigration card\u0002 and custom declaration card?","可以給我入境卡和海關申報單嗎?"]],"in addition to":[["guide-112-24","Most tour guides earn commission on sales \u0001in addition to\u0002 their base salary.","大多數導遊除了底薪外,還從銷售中賺取佣金。"]],"in advance":[["leader-106-23","If you anticipate an event, you realize \u0001in advance\u0002 that it may happen and you are prepared for it.","如果你預期一件事,表示你事先意識到它可能發生,並做好準備。"],["leader-109-71","But booking well \u0001in advance\u0002 is a must as the restaurant needs to prepare their food much earlier.","",1]],"in case":[["guide-111-62","Take a map with you \u0001in case\u0002 you get lost.","帶張地圖在身上,以防迷路。"]],"in case of":[["leader-115-65","Tourists on the plane were reminded how to use oxygen masks \u0001in case of\u0002 emergency.","機上乘客被提醒如何在緊急情況下使用氧氣面罩。"],["guide-107-10","Always keep one backup credit card and bank card with you \u0001in case of\u0002 emergencies.","隨身多帶一張備用信用卡和金融卡,以防緊急狀況。"]],"in cash":[["leader-109-58","The original receipt is required to process a refund to a customer who paid \u0001in cash\u0002.","要為付現的顧客辦理退款,須提供原始收據。"]],"in charge of":[["guide-107-20","You will have to plan where the tour goes and what is seen by the passengers if you are \u0001in charge of\u0002 the tour.","如果你負責這趟行程,你就得規劃行程路線與旅客所見的景點。"]],"in comparison to":[["leader-110-39","In the last decade, online shopping has experienced an explosive growth due to the fact it represents a more economic and convenient approach to purchasing \u0001in comparison to\u0002 traditional shopping.","過去十年,網購爆炸性成長,因為相較於傳統購物,它是更經濟便利的購買方式。"]],"in lieu of":[["leader-115-43","In lieu of","代替",2]],"in memory of":[["guide-106-33","The lofty monument was erected about one hundred years ago \u0001in memory of\u0002 a saint who devoted his entire life to charity.","這座高聳的紀念碑約在一百年前豎立,以紀念一位畢生奉獻於慈善的聖人。"]],"in miniature":[["guide-110-71","A small country, Taiwan is like a world \u0001in miniature\u0002 that has much to offer.","",1]],"in no time":[["guide-115-40","The volcano on the island has been unusually active over the past few days; many residents are afraid that it is going to erupt \u0001in no time\u0002.","島上的火山過去幾天異常活躍;許多居民擔心它很快就要噴發。"]],"in one's favor":[["guide-111-16","Customers are very much in the driver's seat today given all the options for choosing what's \u0001in their favor\u0002 on the internet.","由於網路上有各種對自己有利的選擇,顧客如今很大程度上掌控大局(居主導地位)。"]],"in order to":[["guide-107-53","Some people spent years saving up money \u0001in order to\u0002 take a long-term dream trip.","有些人花好幾年存錢,為了去一趟長期的夢想之旅。"]],"in place":[["guide-109-20","Packing for a vacation is a nightmare. It took me so long to get everything needed \u0001in place\u0002.","為度假打包是場惡夢,我花了好久才把需要的東西都準備好。"]],"in public":[["guide-111-25","He was so mad at the sales clerk's attitude but tried very hard not to make a(an) scene \u0001in public\u0002.","他對店員的態度很火大,但很努力不在公共場合大吵大鬧(出洋相)。"]],"in store":[["guide-106-2","PayPal is a fast and safe way to pay and get paid online, via a mobile apparatus and \u0001in store\u0002.","PayPal 是快速安全的線上收付方式,可透過行動裝置及實體店面使用。"]],"in the air":[["guide-109-71","For some museums in the world, love is \u0001in the air\u0002 all year round.","",1],["guide-109-75","In the article, what do you think “Love is \u0001in the air\u0002” means?","在本文中,你認為「Love is in the air」是什麼意思?"]],"in the driver's seat":[["guide-111-16","Customers are very much \u0001in the driver's seat\u0002 today given all the options for choosing what's in their favor on the internet.","由於網路上有各種對自己有利的選擇,顧客如今很大程度上掌控大局(居主導地位)。"]],"in the field":[["guide-109-40","Chen Guan-zhou used over 40,000 Lego pieces to make Longshan Temple, which made him rocket to fame \u0001in the field\u0002.","陳冠州用超過四萬塊樂高做出龍山寺,這讓他在這領域一舉成名。"]],"in three hours":[["leader-109-9","Clerk: When is your connecting flight? Traveler: It comes \u0001in three hours\u0002.","人員:你的轉機是什麼時候? 旅客:三小時後。"]],"in time":[["leader-109-65","Linda: The tour we booked begins in ten minutes, but there's no way we'll get there \u0001in time\u0002 with such heavy traffic.",""]],"industrial park":[["leader-111-71","Drone delivery hasn't advanced to the point that it will fly up to your 14th floor office window, but in Shanghai's Jinshan \u0001Industrial Park\u0002, drone delivery has already started.","",4]],"information desk":[["guide-112-55","\u0001Information Desk\u0002 Clerk: Are you lost?",""]],"insect bite":[["leader-109-42","The large area of swelling and redness is caused by \u0001insect bites\u0002. Urgent medical attention is necessary.","大範圍的腫脹和發紅是蟲咬所致,需緊急就醫。"]],"insect repellent":[["leader-114-66","Travelers are urged to use \u0001insect repellent\u0002 and wear long-sleeved shirts and long pants when outdoors to prevent mosquito bites.","旅客被呼籲在戶外時使用防蟲液、穿長袖衣和長褲以防蚊蟲叮咬。"]],"instead of":[["leader-109-37","Clerk: Do you know what a stored-value card is for? Traveler: Yes, you use it to pay for things \u0001instead of\u0002 using cash.","人員:你知道儲值卡是做什麼用的嗎? 旅客:知道,用它付款而不用現金。"],["leader-112-58","\u0001Instead of\u0002 driving a long way for vacation, we had a staycation, visiting the local museums and staying in a hotel nearby.","我們沒有開很遠去度假,而是來個宅度假,參觀本地博物館、住附近飯店。"]],"insurance coverage":[["leader-115-41","Before going on the adventure tour, the travel agency advised all participants to check their \u0001insurance coverage\u0002 to ensure medical expenses and trip cancellations are included.","出發冒險行程前,旅行社建議所有團員確認他們的保險範圍,以確保涵蓋醫療費用和行程取消。"]],"interfere with":[["guide-113-66","Guests must not \u0001interfere with\u0002 the electrical network in the hotel rooms without the prior consent of the management department.","未經管理部門的事先同意,房客不得干擾飯店房間的電力網路。"]],"international flight":[["guide-115-58","You need a passport to board an \u0001international flight\u0002 and to enter a country.","你需要護照才能登上國際航班並進入一個國家。"]],"Jadeite Cabbage":[["guide-110-53","One of the most popular pieces of jade carvings in the museum is the \u0001Jadeite Cabbage\u0002.","博物館裡最受歡迎的玉雕之一是翠玉白菜。"]],"Japan Rail Pass":[["leader-113-28","Any traveler who plans to make multiple stops around Japan is advised to check out the \u0001Japan Rail Pass\u0002.","打算在日本各地多次停留的旅客,建議查看日本鐵路周遊券(JR Pass)。"]],"Japanese yen":[["leader-109-69","Clerk: What currency would you like to have your money changed, sir? Customer: I need some \u0001Japanese yen\u0002, please.","櫃台:先生,你想把錢換成什麼貨幣? 顧客:我要一些日圓。"]],"jet lag":[["guide-112-42","Every time when I fly to London, I get serious \u0001jet lag\u0002. It makes me uneasy.","每次飛倫敦,我都會嚴重時差。讓我很不舒服。"]],"jet plane":[["guide-107-80","There's a sense of romance about a train that simply doesn't exist on a modern \u0001jet plane\u0002.","",4]],"joint effort":[["guide-110-16","It takes the \u0001joint efforts\u0002 of both the government and the general public to halt the spread of the virus.","需要政府與大眾共同努力才能遏止病毒的傳播。"]],"jungle trek":[["leader-109-29","Some tour companies advertise \u0001jungle treks\u0002, scuba diving, and other expeditions as \"nature tourism\".","有些旅行社把叢林健行、潛水和其他探險活動宣傳為「自然旅遊」。"]],"keep a promise":[["guide-107-15","He always \u0001keeps promises\u0002 and never breaks his word.","他總是信守承諾,從不食言。"]],"key card":[["leader-110-34","Clerk: Sir, to turn on the electricity in the room you need to place the \u0001key card\u0002 in the socket next to the door.",""]],"king-size bed":[["leader-109-38","In these rooms two twin-size beds can be convertible into a \u0001king-size bed\u0002.","在這些房間,兩張單人床可合併轉換成一張特大床。"]],"known for":[["leader-112-74","Which feature are green products \u0001known for\u0002?","綠色產品以什麼特色聞名?"]],"labor law":[["leader-108-68","The company says it is in full compliance with the domestic \u0001labor laws\u0002.","公司表示完全遵循國內勞動法。"]],"laid back":[["guide-108-19","Our next stop is to Jiufen to enjoy the hillside town's famous cuisine and \u0001laid back\u0002 atmosphere.","下一站是九份,享受這山城著名的美食與悠閒氛圍。"]],"language support":[["guide-108-76","Language support","語言支援(翻譯)",3]],"laundry bag":[["guide-108-58","If you need dry-cleaning service, please leave your clothing items in the \u0001laundry bag\u0002 and fill out the form located in your room.","若你需要乾洗服務,請把衣物放進洗衣袋,並填寫房內的表單。"]],"lay eggs":[["leader-112-79","According to the passage, when do sea turtles likely \u0001lay eggs\u0002?","根據本文,海龜大約何時產卵?"]],"lean to the right":[["leader-114-73","If a passenger tends to \u0001lean to the right\u0002 when falling asleep, what will be the best seat?","若乘客入睡時傾向往右靠,最佳座位為何?"]],"learner license":[["leader-107-52","Teens looking to drive can start a driver's education course as soon as they turn 14 years old - but they must wait until they are 15 years of age to be eligible for a \u0001learner license\u0002 in Texas.","想開車的青少年一滿 14 歲就能開始上駕訓課,但在德州須等到 15 歲才符合資格申請學習駕照。"]],"less busy":[["leader-109-45","It is always cheaper to travel at off peak train times that are \u0001less busy\u0002.","在較不繁忙的離峰火車時段旅行總是比較便宜。"]],"less expensive":[["leader-113-73","If time is not an issue, direct flights are ideal since they are often \u0001less expensive\u0002 than non-stop flights.","",4],["guide-108-13","It's faster and \u0001less expensive\u0002 to take the shuttle from the airport to the hotel.","搭接駁車從機場到飯店又快又省錢。"]],"let up":[["guide-112-15","After days of nonstop rain, it finally \u0001let up\u0002 today.","連日不停的雨後,今天終於停了(放晴)。"]],"lie along":[["guide-114-20","Lukang \u0001lies along\u0002 the west coast of Taiwan. It had the largest population in Taiwan during the Qing period.","鹿港位於台灣西海岸。它在清代擁有全台最多的人口。"]],"life jacket":[["leader-112-3","Flight attendant: Don't inflate your \u0001life jacket\u0002 until you've left the plane in case of emergency.","空服員:緊急時,離開飛機前請勿為救生衣充氣。"]],"light display":[["guide-108-43","Organizers use modern technology to provide an exciting \u0001light display\u0002 in addition to hanging elaborate traditional lanterns.","主辦單位運用現代科技提供精彩的燈光秀,還掛上精緻的傳統燈籠。"]],"line up":[["guide-107-47","This website introduces the best travel planning apps which could help you plan your itinerary, and make sure your tickets and connections are all \u0001lined up\u0002.","這網站介紹最棒的旅遊規劃 App,能幫你規劃行程,確保機票與接駁都安排妥當。"]],"litter interceptor":[["leader-109-79","Trash Wheel, a \u0001litter interceptor\u0002 in Maryland's Baltimore Harbor, can be effective at picking up large pieces of plastic, such as foam cups and food containers, from inland waters.","",4]],"local language":[["leader-107-26","A simple \"Please,\" \"Thank you,\" and \"I'm sorry\" in the \u0001local language\u0002 goes a long way when you are on a trip.","旅途中,用當地語言簡單說聲「請」「謝謝」「對不起」很有幫助(受用無窮)。"]],"local map":[["leader-110-49","Traveler: May I have a \u0001local map\u0002? Receptionist: Sure, here you go.","旅客:能給我一張當地地圖嗎? 櫃台:當然,拿去吧。"]],"log into":[["leader-107-60","When you are traveling, try to avoid \u0001logging into\u0002 bank accounts or entering any passwords while using free public WiFi at a place like an airport.","旅行時,在機場等地用免費公共 WiFi,盡量避免登入銀行帳戶或輸入任何密碼。"],["leader-111-64","At public places such as libraries, hotels, and airports, free Wi-Fi is very convenient but not secure. Travelers should avoid \u0001logging into\u0002 bank accounts and entering passwords at these public areas because someone else might see them.","在圖書館、飯店、機場等公共場所,免費 Wi-Fi 很方便但不安全。旅客應避免在這些公共區域登入銀行帳戶或輸入密碼,以免被他人看到。"]],"long distance call":[["leader-110-11","Domestic \u0001long distance calls\u0002 are 3 dollars per minute.",""],["guide-112-53","Tourist: I'd like to make a \u0001long distance call\u0002 to New York.",""]],"long-distance call":[["leader-112-63","Excuse me, could you show me how to make a domestic \u0001long-distance call\u0002 from San Diego to New York?","不好意思,能教我怎麼從聖地牙哥打國內長途電話到紐約嗎?"]],"look forward to":[["leader-114-17","The past few weeks have been busy, and I'm \u0001looking forward to\u0002 the vacation next month.","過去幾週很忙,我很期待下個月的假期。"]],"look through":[["leader-109-19","The receptionist in the Tourist Information Center asks a guest to \u0001look through\u0002 the brochure first and then he will answer his inquiry later.","遊客中心的櫃台請客人先翻閱簡介,之後再回答他的詢問。"]],"lose one's way":[["guide-115-30","I seem to have \u0001lost my way\u0002.",""]],"lose weight":[["leader-108-57","If you try to \u0001lose weight\u0002, reduced-calorie cheese is a great substitute for cream cheese.","若你想減重,低卡起司是奶油起司很好的替代品。"]],"lost and found":[["guide-108-46","We found your spectacles, but they are at the \u0001lost and found\u0002 department.","我們找到你的眼鏡了,但它們在失物招領部門。"]],"Lost and Found":[["leader-112-31","You can go to the \u0001Lost and Found\u0002 Service Center for your missing items.","你可以到失物招領中心找你遺失的物品。"],["guide-115-30","You may try your luck at the Lost and Found.","你可以去失物招領處碰碰運氣。",2]],"low season":[["guide-109-19","You can get a lower rate when taking a vacation during the \u0001low season\u0002.","在淡季度假可以拿到比較低的價格。"]],"loyalty program":[["leader-112-13","Some hotel \u0001loyalty programs\u0002 award elite members upgrade benefits after staying a certain number of nights.","有些飯店會員計畫在住滿一定晚數後,給予尊榮會員升等優惠。"]],"lucky knot":[["guide-108-41","During Chinese New Year, houses are decorated with fresh flowers, Spring Festival Couplets and traditional \u0001lucky knots\u0002.","農曆新年期間,家家戶戶裝飾著鮮花、春聯和傳統吉祥結。"]],"luggage search":[["leader-111-32","Ground staff: You have been selected for a random \u0001luggage search\u0002.",""]],"lunar calendar":[["guide-110-69","The Mazu pilgrimage from Dajia's Zhenlan Temple takes place during the third month of the Chinese \u0001lunar calendar\u0002.","大甲鎮瀾宮的媽祖遶境進香在農曆三月舉行。"]],"lunch special":[["guide-109-7","Today's \u0001lunch special\u0002 is beef lasagna. It comes with a medium coke.","今日午間特餐是牛肉千層麵,附一杯中杯可樂。"]],"main course":[["leader-108-37","Dinner features a hot entrée of chicken, veal, or lamb. After the \u0001main course\u0002, dessert will be served.","晚餐主打雞、小牛或羊肉的熱主菜。主菜之後會上甜點。"],["guide-113-44","The restaurant's appetizers, including crispy calamari, stuffed mushrooms, and savory sliders, left us eagerly anticipating the \u0001main course\u0002.","這家餐廳的開胃菜,包括酥炸花枝、鑲蘑菇和美味小漢堡,讓我們熱切期待主餐。"]],"main dish":[["leader-107-18","We ordered two appetizers, chicken wings and Mozzarella sticks, salad and soup before the \u0001main dish\u0002.","我們在主菜前點了兩道開胃菜——雞翅和莫札瑞拉起司條、沙拉和湯。"]],"main entrance":[["guide-109-54","A: Where does the tour start off? B: At the \u0001main entrance\u0002.","A:導覽從哪裡出發? B:在正門口。"]],"main idea":[["guide-106-74","What is the \u0001main idea\u0002 of this passage?","本文的主旨是什麼?"]],"make a call":[["leader-106-58","It is a very old hotel. I still have to \u0001make calls\u0002 through the operator.","這是間很老的飯店,我仍得透過接線生打電話。"]],"make a face":[["guide-106-64","The monkey became aggressive and started making angry hissing sounds after one of his friends \u0001made a face\u0002 at it.","有人對牠扮鬼臉後,猴子變得有攻擊性,開始發出憤怒的嘶嘶聲。"]],"make an arrangement":[["guide-111-60","Could you help me \u0001make an arrangement\u0002?","你能幫我做個安排嗎?"]],"make good use of":[["leader-109-76","Which of the following is NOT considered to be \u0001making good use of\u0002 plastics according to the passage?","根據本文,下列何者不算善用塑膠?"]],"make the most of":[["leader-115-46","These essential travel tips will help you avoid common travel mistakes and \u0001make the most of\u0002 your journey.","這些必備的旅遊訣竅能幫你避免常見的旅行錯誤,充分享受旅程。"]],"make up for":[["leader-109-54","To ease the customer's anger, the manager offered her a free meal to \u0001make up for\u0002 the problem. But she still felt displeased.","為平息顧客的怒氣,經理招待她一頓免費餐彌補問題,但她仍不滿意。"]],"manage to":[["leader-108-49","John \u0001managed to\u0002 find a perfect duplicate of the ring his wife had lost.","John 設法找到一枚跟他太太弄丟的戒指一模一樣的複製品。"]],"Mao Gong Ding":[["guide-110-54","The interior surface of the \u0001Mao Gong Ding\u0002 is covered in a/an inscription of 500 characters.","毛公鼎的內壁刻滿了 500 字的銘文。"]],"marine debris":[["leader-112-76","… the environment, a team of volunteers, consisting of university students in Taiwan, non-profit organizations, and residents have started to conduct a project about environmental protection, including sea turtle conservation and \u0001marine-debris\u0002 decoration.","",1]],"marine organism":[["leader-109-80","Millions of animals are killed by plastics every year, from birds to fish to other \u0001marine organisms\u0002.","",4]],"mass tourism":[["leader-106-76","Geotourism provides an alternative to traditional \u0001mass tourism\u0002, the effects of which can be harmful to the local people as well as to the environment.","",1],["leader-114-56","mass tourism","大眾觀光",2]],"mass transit":[["guide-107-76","Car makers, airline owners, and the planners of \u0001mass transit\u0002 systems all share a common goal.","",1]],"means of transportation":[["guide-115-5","Taking a bus to get to Yangmingshan is a better \u0001means of transportation\u0002 during the period of traffic control for the Flower Festival.","花季期間有交通管制,搭公車上陽明山是比較好的交通方式。"]],"medical expenses":[["leader-115-41","Before going on the adventure tour, the travel agency advised all participants to check their insurance coverage to ensure \u0001medical expenses\u0002 and trip cancellations are included.","出發冒險行程前,旅行社建議所有團員確認他們的保險範圍,以確保涵蓋醫療費用和行程取消。"]],"medical facility":[["guide-110-5","During the COVID-19 pandemic, travelers should remember to share their previous travel history with their health care providers and make every effort to inform them by phone before visiting a \u0001medical facility\u0002.","疫情期間,旅客應記得與醫療人員分享先前的旅遊史,並在就醫前盡力以電話通知他們。"]],"medical service":[["leader-110-66","The \u0001medical service\u0002 is very different from Taiwan to the US. In the US, you need a prescription to buy contact lenses.","美台醫療制度差很多。在美國,你需要處方箋才能買隱形眼鏡。"]],"medical tourism":[["leader-114-29","\u0001Medical tourism\u0002 refers to traveling for medical treatment in other countries, often for better services or lower costs.","醫療旅遊指的是到其他國家接受醫療治療,通常是為了更好的服務或更低的費用。"]],"medicine bag":[["guide-112-58","Pharmacist: The directions are in the \u0001medicine bag\u0002.",""]],"medium of exchange":[["leader-106-42","A \u0001medium of exchange\u0002 is anything that is used to determine value during the exchange of goods and services.","交易媒介是在商品與服務交換過程中,用來決定/衡量價值的任何東西。"]],"memorial hall":[["leader-108-7","Are there any sightseeing tours for the \u0001memorial hall\u0002?","有沒有紀念館的觀光導覽行程?"]],"memory card":[["guide-109-27","A: How big is the \u0001memory card\u0002? B: It is 36 megapixels.","A:這張記憶卡多大容量? B:它是 3,600 萬畫素。(本題官方一律給分)"]],"merits and concerns":[["leader-115-75","Reminding readers the merits and concerns about tourism development","提醒讀者觀光發展的優點與隱憂",3]],"metro station":[["leader-113-38","I'm trying to find the nearest \u0001metro station\u0002.",""]],"Michelin Guide":[["guide-107-52","The \u0001Michelin Guide\u0002 Taipei, also known as the bible for global fine cuisine, will be available in Taiwan in the first quarter of 2018.","被譽為全球精緻餐飲聖經的《台北米其林指南》,將於 2018 年第一季在台問世。"]],"Michelin star":[["guide-110-46","The restaurant is well known for its authentic Taiwanese cuisines to receive three \u0001Michelin stars\u0002 for two consecutive years.","這家餐廳以其道地的台灣菜聞名,連續兩年獲得米其林三星。"]],"Middle Easterners":[["leader-107-78","However, in their own public settings, where crowding is impossible to avoid, they accept body contact or just seem to ignore it, \"touching without feeling.\" Latins and \u0001Middle Easterners\u0002, on the other hand, stand much closer than Americans.","",4]],"mineral spring":[["guide-110-45","These Herbal \u0001Mineral Springs\u0002 provide herbal therapeutic springs and beautifying mineral baths.","這些草本礦泉提供草本療效溫泉與美容礦物浴。"]],"mining town":[["guide-110-3","Telluride, a Victorian-era \u0001mining town\u0002 in Colorado, is a winter paradise offering plenty to do and isn't as crowded as some of Colorado's other destinations.","泰勒瑞德是科羅拉多州一座維多利亞時代的礦業小鎮,是個冬季天堂,有很多活動,也不像科羅拉多其他景點那麼擁擠。"]],"minor injury":[["leader-114-48","It's important to be prepared for any \u0001minor injuries\u0002.",""]],"Mixed Reality":[["guide-108-80","Applications of technologies such as VR (Virtual Reality), AR (Augmented Reality) and MR (\u0001Mixed Reality\u0002) in tourism have expanded the market and created revolutionary business opportunities.","",4]],"mixed review":[["leader-109-75","Is this article a \u0001mixed review\u0002?","這篇文章是「褒貶並陳」的評論嗎?"]],"modern museum":[["leader-110-79","The challenge was in turning a historical building into a \u0001modern museum\u0002 equipped to cater for a large ever-growing number of visitors.","",4]],"modest fee":[["leader-106-71","Every day, for a very \u0001modest fee\u0002 (only 300 rupees per month), the dabbawallas collect freshly cooked meals from their customers' home and deliver to the nearest train station by bicycle before 9:00 a.m.","",1]],"money changer":[["guide-112-8","When traveling abroad, you should carefully choose the \u0001money changers\u0002 to convert currencies.","出國旅行時,你應謹慎選擇換匯處來兌換貨幣。"]],"mosquito bite":[["leader-114-66","Travelers are urged to use insect repellent and wear long-sleeved shirts and long pants when outdoors to prevent \u0001mosquito bites\u0002.","旅客被呼籲在戶外時使用防蟲液、穿長袖衣和長褲以防蚊蟲叮咬。"]],"mountain village":[["guide-115-48","Jiufen, a \u0001mountain village\u0002 in New Taipei City, is a popular destination for international travelers mainly because of its old street.","九份是新北市的山城,主要因其老街而成為國際旅客熱門景點。"]],"move in":[["leader-109-52","We have just moved in.","我們剛搬進來。",2]],"MRT station":[["guide-112-2","Tourists may orient themselves in the city if there is a giant map at the exit of each \u0001MRT station\u0002 in Taipei.","若台北每個捷運站出口都有大地圖,遊客就能在城市中辨明方向。"]],"museum pass":[["leader-115-31","When visiting museums and other attractions in Paris, even if you have purchased a \u0001museum pass\u0002, making a(n) reservation is still required.","在巴黎參觀博物館等景點時,即使買了博物館通票,仍需要事先預約。"]],"National Palace Museum":[["leader-109-44","Clerk: I recommend the \u0001National Palace Museum\u0002 with lots of artifacts.",""],["leader-112-19","The hotel offers easy access to the \u0001National Palace Museum\u0002.","這間飯店可輕鬆前往國立故宮博物院。"]],"national park":[["leader-110-7","Yosemite \u0001National Park\u0002, Yellowstone National Park, and Central Park all are on the top sightseeing spots in USA.","優勝美地、黃石和中央公園都是美國頂級觀光景點。"]],"natural resources":[["leader-106-21","Overconsumption is having a serious impact on \u0001natural resources\u0002.","過度消費正對自然資源造成嚴重衝擊。"]],"natural wonder":[["guide-112-43","Niagara Falls is an impressive \u0001natural wonder\u0002, and I enjoy its spectacular view.","尼加拉瀑布是令人印象深刻的自然奇景,我很享受它壯觀的景色。"]],"nature reserve":[["guide-107-58","\u0001Nature reserves\u0002 are established to protect iconic, special, and endangered species of plants and animals.","自然保留區的設立是為了保護具代表性、特殊與瀕危的動植物物種。"]],"net income":[["leader-113-70","With air fares rising faster than inflation, global airline bosses now expect $9.8 billion in \u0001net income\u0002 this year, more than double the amount initially forecasted.","由於機票上漲速度快過通膨,全球航空業主管如今預期今年淨利達 98 億美元,是原先預估的兩倍多。"]],"net zero emissions":[["leader-115-76","The sector must continue developing long-term strategies and targets consistent with the Paris Agreement and latest scientific recommendations, aligned to relevant national and international policies and strategies, to achieve \u0001net zero emissions\u0002 goals.","",1]],"new Taiwan dollar":[["leader-110-47","Traveler: May I pay by \u0001new Taiwan dollar\u0002 here? Clerk: Sorry, we only take US dollar.","旅客:我能用新台幣付款嗎? 店員:抱歉,我們只收美金。"]],"New Taiwan Dollar":[["leader-111-67","The exchange rate between \u0001New Taiwan Dollars\u0002 and the Euros has not changed much recently.","新台幣與歐元之間的匯率近來沒什麼變動。"]],"news outlet":[["leader-107-73","When the restaurant was launched, it was covered by CBC and other \u0001news outlets\u0002 just for the selfie room, and it was a hot talking point on social media.","",4]],"news report":[["leader-111-18","Have you read the \u0001news report\u0002 on the new variant of COVID-19?","你讀過關於 COVID-19 新變種的新聞報導了嗎?"],["guide-107-75","A news report","新聞報導",3]],"Niagara Falls":[["guide-112-43","\u0001Niagara Falls\u0002 is an impressive natural wonder, and I enjoy its spectacular view.","尼加拉瀑布是令人印象深刻的自然奇景,我很享受它壯觀的景色。"]],"night market":[["leader-112-26","The \u0001night market\u0002 was packed with many people during holidays.","假日時夜市擠滿了人。"],["guide-107-21","No trip to Kaohsiung is complete without paying the city's \u0001night markets\u0002 a visit.","到高雄若沒造訪當地夜市,就不算完整的旅程。"]],"no matter how":[["leader-114-75","What does the sentence \"\u0001no matter how\u0002 much research you do, your flight might have other plans\" suggest?","「無論你做多少研究,你的航班可能另有打算」這句暗示什麼?"]],"No Smoking":[["guide-112-57","Flight attendant: Ladies and gentlemen, soon we will be landing at O'Hare International Airport. Please fasten your seat belts and observe the \u0001No Smoking\u0002 sign.","空服員:各位女士先生,我們即將降落芝加哥歐海爾國際機場。請繫好安全帶並遵守禁菸標誌。"]],"northern lights":[["leader-114-71","\"If I'm flying a polar route, I try to be on the side of the plane that will face north during local nightfall in case I have an opportunity to witness the \u0001northern lights\u0002,\" says atmospheric scientist Matthew Cappucci.","",1]],"observation deck":[["guide-106-18","Standing on the \u0001observation deck\u0002 to enjoy the breathtaking view is a must when you visit this National Park.","站在觀景台欣賞令人屏息的景致,是造訪這座國家公園時的必做之事。"]],"ocean current":[["guide-106-80","The Gulf Stream is the largest ocean current in the world.","灣流是世界最大的洋流。",2]],"office hours":[["guide-112-10","Should you have any questions regarding the loss of your wallet and passport abroad, feel free to contact us anytime during \u0001office hours\u0002.","若你在國外有任何關於錢包和護照遺失的問題,歡迎在辦公時間隨時與我們聯繫。"]],"offshore island":[["guide-113-37","Riding a scooter is one of the best ways to explore Taiwan. On the \u0001offshore islands\u0002, going around by scooter is practically essential.","騎機車是探索台灣最好的方式之一。在離島以機車代步幾乎是必要的。"]],"oil paper umbrella":[["guide-107-64","The Hakka town of Meinong in southern Taiwan is famous for its \u0001oil paper umbrellas\u0002, which not only provide shelter from the sun but also symbolize good fortune.","台灣南部的客家小鎮美濃以其油紙傘聞名,不僅能遮陽,也象徵好運。"]],"on a tight budget":[["guide-109-18","We are \u0001on a tight budget\u0002, so we want to plan a vacation that doesn't cost too much.","我們預算緊,所以想規劃一趟不太花錢的旅行。"]],"on a trip":[["leader-107-26","A simple \"Please,\" \"Thank you,\" and \"I'm sorry\" in the local language goes a long way when you are \u0001on a trip\u0002.","旅途中,用當地語言簡單說聲「請」「謝謝」「對不起」很有幫助(受用無窮)。"]],"on behalf of":[["leader-114-27","I apologize \u0001on behalf of\u0002 the company for our waitress's error, and we will cover the cost of dry cleaning.","我代表公司為我們服務生的錯誤道歉,我們會負擔乾洗費用。"]],"on board":[["leader-109-26","Welcome \u0001on board\u0002.",""],["leader-109-55","While we're \u0001on board\u0002, we can get some great shots of the waterfront. They will be wonderful pictures.","在船上時,我們可以拍些很棒的濱水區照片,一定很漂亮。"]],"on display":[["guide-107-54","The National Palace Museum provides a special children's audio guide to allow children to learn more about the exhibitions \u0001on display\u0002.","故宮提供兒童專屬語音導覽,讓孩子更了解展出的展品。"]],"on exhibition":[["leader-115-63","This artist's masterpieces are \u0001on exhibition\u0002 at the museum.","這位藝術家的傑作正在博物館展出。"]],"on foot":[["leader-107-22","There are many different types of scenery in the park. The best way to see them is to go \u0001on foot\u0002.","公園裡有許多不同的景緻。看它們最好的方式就是步行。"],["leader-115-35","The city's urban center is quite compact and easy to explore \u0001on foot\u0002 or by bike.","這座城市的市中心相當緊湊,很適合步行或騎單車遊覽。"]],"on me":[["leader-112-55","It is \u0001on me\u0002 today.",""]],"on sale":[["leader-110-16","This shirt was \u0001on sale\u0002.",""],["guide-109-56","I heard books are \u0001on sale\u0002 in the store this month. Maybe we can get a good bargain there.","我聽說這個月書店特價,也許我們能在那撿到划算貨。"]],"on the way":[["leader-113-50","A: Do you know where I can buy a plug adaptor around here? B: If you follow the signs to the train station, there is a mall \u0001on the way\u0002.","A:你知道這附近哪裡能買到轉接插頭嗎? B:沿指標往火車站走,路上有間購物中心。"]],"on time":[["leader-106-72","Being on time","準時",3],["guide-110-1","The greatest tour guides are punctual and organized, helping their guests get to where they need to be \u0001on time\u0002.","最優秀的導遊準時又有條理,幫助客人準時抵達該去的地方。"]],"one another":[["leader-115-25","We have prepared a pin for you to wear on your backpack, so the members in our group can recognize \u0001one another\u0002 very easily.","我們幫你準備了別在背包上的別針,這樣團員可以很容易認出彼此。"]],"one way":[["guide-112-56","Passenger: What's the bus fare to The Metropolitan Museum of Art? John: Two dollars \u0001one way\u0002, three dollars round trip.","乘客:到大都會藝術博物館的公車票價多少? John:單程兩美元,來回三美元。"]],"onward flight":[["guide-114-45","To access the business class lounges in the Taoyuan International Airport, all passengers must have already checked in for their \u0001onward flight\u0002 and be in possession of a valid boarding pass.","要進入桃園國際機場的商務艙貴賓室,所有旅客必須已辦好接續航班的報到,並持有有效的登機證。"]],"onward ticket":[["leader-113-69","Do you have a return or onward ticket?","你有回程或續程機票嗎?",2]],"open to the public":[["guide-109-50","A: Do I need tickets for Taiwan Culinary Exhibition? B: It's free and \u0001open to the public\u0002.","A:台灣美食展需要門票嗎? B:免費且對大眾開放。"]],"opening hours":[["leader-115-19","Tourists are highly recommended to pay attention to the \u0001opening hours\u0002 of different museums because they vary a lot.","強烈建議遊客留意各博物館的開放時間,因為差異很大。"]],"operating cost":[["leader-111-71","Ele.me says the drone delivery method greatly reduces \u0001operating costs\u0002.","",1]],"organic material":[["guide-113-20","Travelers who bring food and other \u0001organic material\u0002 back to their countries can often unintentionally carry pests and other risks.","把食物和其他有機物帶回國的旅客,常常會無意間攜帶害蟲和其他風險。"]],"organized crime":[["guide-110-68","\u0001Organized crime\u0002 has run rampant due to the inaction of the government.","由於政府的無作為,組織犯罪已猖獗橫行。"]],"original receipt":[["leader-109-58","The \u0001original receipt\u0002 is required to process a refund to a customer who paid in cash.","要為付現的顧客辦理退款,須提供原始收據。"]],"out of control":[["guide-106-29","All of a sudden, the plane was \u0001out of control\u0002. It eventually crashed into the sea, killing the crew and all the passengers.","突然間,飛機失控了,最終墜海,機組人員與全體乘客罹難。"]],"overhead bin":[["leader-109-70","Flight attendants can help senior citizens to lift and stow their hand carry luggage to the \u0001overhead bins\u0002.","空服員可協助年長者把隨身行李抬起並收放到頭頂置物櫃。"],["leader-113-66","Due to limited space in the \u0001overhead bins\u0002, passengers are advised to bring only one carry-on bag on the plane.","由於頭頂置物櫃空間有限,建議乘客只帶一件隨身行李上機。"]],"overhead compartment":[["leader-110-45","Captain: We are going to take off. Please fasten your seatbelt at this time and secure all baggage underneath your seat or in the \u0001overhead compartment\u0002.","機長:我們即將起飛。請此時繫好安全帶,並將所有行李固定放妥於座椅下方或頭頂置物櫃。"],["guide-112-69","Ladies and gentlemen, please be careful while opening the \u0001overhead compartment\u0002 as any items stowed inside might fall out, and take all your personal belongings with you.","各位女士先生,打開頭頂行李櫃時請小心,因為裡面放的物品可能掉出來;並請帶走所有隨身物品。"]],"oxygen mask":[["leader-115-65","Tourists on the plane were reminded how to use \u0001oxygen masks\u0002 in case of emergency.","機上乘客被提醒如何在緊急情況下使用氧氣面罩。"]],"oyster omelet":[["leader-110-42","Attendant: \u0001Oyster Omelet\u0002.",""],["guide-108-35","\u0001Oyster omelets\u0002 are made up of eggs, oysters, and vegetables and are eaten with special sauce.","蚵仔煎由蛋、牡蠣和蔬菜組成,並沾特製醬料食用。"]],"pack light":[["leader-111-6","I prefer to \u0001pack light\u0002. Does your hotel provide free toiletries?","我喜歡輕便打包。你們飯店有提供免費盥洗用品嗎?"]],"package holiday":[["leader-106-9","Tour operators regularly use brochures and the Internet to advertise their \u0001package holidays\u0002 and tours.","旅遊業者經常用簡介手冊和網路來宣傳套裝假期和行程。"]],"package tour":[["leader-111-11","Receptionist: Our one-day \u0001package tour\u0002 includes a guided tour of the city and free transportation. Guest: That sounds perfect.","櫃台:我們的一日套裝行程含城市導覽和免費接送(交通)。 客人:聽起來很完美。"],["guide-107-65","Due to increased competition from foreign travel agencies, local travel agencies were forced to lower the prices of \u0001package tours\u0002 to attract tourists.","由於外國旅行社競爭加劇,本地旅行社被迫調降套裝行程價格以吸引遊客。"]],"paid call":[["leader-110-22","Is this a \u0001paid call\u0002?",""]],"parking lot":[["leader-111-31","A cellphone \u0001parking lot\u0002 is a parking lot where people wait for their friends to complete their landing procedures.","「手機停車場」是人們等候朋友完成降落(入境)手續的停車場。"]],"participate in":[["guide-108-30","Many tourists take advantage of relaxing activities by \u0001participating in\u0002 outdoor sports such as diving, cycling, and hiking.","許多遊客藉由潛水、騎車、健行等戶外運動善用放鬆的活動。"]],"pass by":[["guide-107-18","Along the routes, you will \u0001pass by\u0002 a number of famous temples.","沿途你會經過好幾座著名廟宇。"]],"passport control":[["guide-108-54","After leaving the aircraft, follow signs for arrivals and go through \u0001passport control\u0002. You must show all your travel documents.","下機後,循入境指標前往護照查驗。你必須出示所有旅行證件。"]],"pay back":[["leader-106-12","Refund is a sum of money that is \u0001paid back\u0002 to you, especially because you have paid too much or you are not happy with something you have.","退款是退還給你的一筆錢,尤其因為你付太多、或對買到的東西不滿意。"]],"pay for":[["guide-113-67","What time do people usually have to check out of the hotel if they don't want to \u0001pay for\u0002 another day?","如果不想多付一天的錢,人們通常必須幾點退房?"]],"pay homage to":[["guide-106-39","Confucius' Birthday is celebrated annually on September 28th. On that day, there will be a ceremony held to \u0001pay homage to\u0002 Confucius.","孔子誕辰於每年 9 月 28 日每年慶祝。當天會舉行祭孔典禮。"]],"pay phone":[["leader-111-36","Foreign guest: Where could I find a(n) \u0001pay phone\u0002?",""]],"pay tribute to":[["leader-107-12","On August 31, 2017, Britain \u0001paid tribute to\u0002 Princess Diana on the twentieth anniversary of her death. She died in a high-speed car crash in Paris on August 31, 1997.","2017 年 8 月 31 日,英國在黛安娜王妃逝世 20 週年向她致敬。她 1997 年同日在巴黎一場高速車禍中身亡。"]],"pay up":[["guide-115-45","Ask for permission before you take close-up photographs of people, and if payment is requested, either \u0001pay up\u0002 or put the camera away.","拍攝人物特寫前先徵求許可;若對方要求付費,要嘛付錢,要嘛把相機收起來。"]],"peak season":[["guide-113-13","When traveling to popular tourist destinations during \u0001peak season\u0002, encountering crowds is inevitably a part of the experience.","在旺季前往熱門旅遊景點時,遇到人潮不可避免地是體驗的一部分。"]],"pepper bun":[["guide-110-40","I am allergic to pork. Is there any in this \u0001Pepper Bun\u0002?","我對豬肉過敏。這個胡椒餅裡有任何(豬肉)嗎?"]],"performing arts":[["guide-108-32","Through holding many festivals and exhibitions, the government is dedicated to promoting Taiwanese traditional crafts and \u0001performing arts\u0002.","政府透過舉辦許多節慶與展覽,致力於推廣台灣傳統工藝與表演藝術。"]],"periodic ticket":[["leader-113-36","A \u0001Periodic Ticket\u0002 allows an unlimited number of rides to and from designated stations at a bargain rate within the offer validity period. The discount is calculated based on the full fares for Non-reserved Seats.","定期票在效期內,可於指定車站間無限次搭乘,享優惠費率。折扣依非劃位車廂的全票價計算。"]],"personal boundaries":[["guide-114-10","Good interpersonal skills in guiding include understanding and respecting \u0001personal boundaries\u0002.","帶團良好的人際技巧,包括理解並尊重個人界線(分際)。"]],"personal space":[["leader-107-76","Anthropologists tell us that each of us walks around inside \"bubbles of \u0001personal space\u0002.\" The size of the bubble represents our personal territory, territorial imperative, or \"personal buffer zone.\" We neither like nor tolerate it when someone invades our…","",4]],"phone number":[["guide-108-12","I can't remember the taxi company's \u0001phone number\u0002. You'd better look in the directory.","我記不得計程車行的電話,你最好查一下電話簿。"]],"physical distance":[["leader-107-76","the physical distance between people","人與人之間的實體距離",3]],"Piccadilly Circus":[["guide-110-39","When I was in London, I would usually walk along the \u0001Piccadilly Circus\u0002 after dinner.","我在倫敦時,晚餐後常會沿著皮卡迪利圓環散步。"]],"pick up":[["leader-113-75","Unlike the non-stop flight, the plane makes a stop en route to the final destination for refueling and \u0001picking up\u0002 and dropping off passengers.","",4],["guide-111-66","A: Can I \u0001pick up\u0002 the car at the airport? B: No, but we can arrange for transportation to our lot.","A:我可以在機場取車嗎? B:不行,但我們可以安排交通接送到我們的租車場。"]],"pineapple cake":[["leader-110-54","I just brought back some \u0001pineapple cakes\u0002 from Taiwan.",""],["guide-107-23","\u0001Pineapple cake\u0002, one of Taiwan's best food souvenirs, is made with pineapples or winter melon.","鳳梨酥是台灣最棒的伴手禮之一,是用鳳梨或冬瓜製成。"]],"Pinot Noir":[["leader-112-29","A: Shall we order a bottle of the house red? B: Yes, today's \u0001Pinot Noir\u0002 goes well with steaks.","A:我們要不要點瓶招牌紅酒? B:好,今天的黑皮諾很配牛排。"]],"Plague God Boat":[["guide-110-70","The burning of the \u0001Plague God Boat\u0002 is a folk ritual practiced by fishermen in southwestern Taiwan.","燒王船是台灣西南部漁民奉行的民俗儀式。"]],"platform gap":[["guide-114-56","Ladies and Gentlemen, we will soon make a brief stop at Tainan Station. Please make sure you have all your personal belongings with you, and mind the \u0001platform gap\u0002 when alighting.","各位女士先生,我們即將在台南站短暫停靠。請確認隨身攜帶所有個人物品,下車時請留意月台間隙。"]],"plug adaptor":[["leader-113-50","A: Do you know where I can buy a \u0001plug adaptor\u0002 around here? B: If you follow the signs to the train station, there is a mall on the way.","A:你知道這附近哪裡能買到轉接插頭嗎? B:沿指標往火車站走,路上有間購物中心。"]],"point out":[["leader-115-70","While we are en route to our next destination, I will \u0001point out\u0002 the beautiful beach and the famous golf course for your reference.","在我們前往下一個目的地的途中,我會為各位指出美麗的海灘和著名的高爾夫球場。"]],"polar route":[["leader-114-71","\"If I'm flying a \u0001polar route\u0002, I try to be on the side of the plane that will face north during local nightfall in case I have an opportunity to witness the northern lights,\" says atmospheric scientist Matthew Cappucci.","",1]],"popular science":[["guide-106-77","A popular science magazine","科普雜誌",3]],"pound key":[["leader-112-65","\"#\" is called the \u0001pound key\u0002, and is a button on a telephone or keyboard labeled.","「#」被稱作井字鍵,是電話或鍵盤上的一個按鍵。"]],"power bank":[["guide-115-10","Recent news about a fire onboard an airliner has sparked renewed concerns over the safety of \u0001power banks\u0002 during air travel.","近期一起客機機上失火的新聞引發了大家對航程中行動電源安全的重新關注。"]],"power cut":[["guide-108-29","Visitors sometimes experience earthquakes during their stay in Taiwan and may suffer from \u0001power cuts\u0002 and hampered transportation.","旅客在台停留期間有時會遇到地震,並可能因停電與交通受阻而受苦。"]],"prior to":[["leader-112-12","To maintain your rights, please arrive at the airport three hours \u0001prior to\u0002 your departure time for tax refund application.","為保障權益,請於出發前三小時抵達機場辦理退稅申請。"],["guide-112-50","You need to reconfirm your flight 72 hours \u0001prior to\u0002 departure directly with the airline or simply check-in online at the applicable airline's website.","你需要在起飛前 72 小時直接向航空公司再次確認你的航班,或直接在該航空公司網站線上報到。"]],"priority boarding":[["guide-113-45","With \u0001priority boarding\u0002, my parents were among the first to step onto the plane, ensuring a stress-free start on their journey.","有了優先登機,我父母是最早登機的一批人之一,確保旅程有個無壓力的開始。"]],"project management":[["leader-110-9","Make the reservation early if you would like to attend next Tuesday's seminar on \u0001project management\u0002.","若你想參加下週二關於專案管理的研討會,請早點預約。"]],"public phone":[["leader-111-14","Foreign guest: How could I use this \u0001public phone\u0002 to make a collect call? Tour leader: Please dial 108.","外國客人:我怎麼用這支公共電話打對方付費電話? 領隊:請撥 108。"]],"public transportation":[["leader-110-60","Due to the COVID-19, now everyone who takes the \u0001public transportation\u0002 is required to wear a mask.","由於 COVID-19,現在搭乘大眾運輸的每個人都須戴口罩。"],["leader-111-49","Many hotels in New York provide free airport shuttle service. You could also take the subway if you are comfortable with \u0001public transportation\u0002.","紐約許多飯店提供免費機場接駁服務。若你習慣搭大眾運輸,也可搭地鐵。"]],"pull off":[["guide-107-51","When the athlete \u0001pulled off\u0002 one of his greatest performances, he received a standing ovation from the audience.","當這位運動員完成他最精彩的表現之一時,獲得觀眾起立鼓掌。"]],"pull over":[["leader-115-69","Escort: Could you \u0001pull over\u0002 safely and switch on the hazard warning lights, please?",""]],"put off":[["leader-115-53","put off","延後",2],["guide-110-41","While many people are \u0001put off\u0002 by the smell of stinky tofu, those who take the plunge are usually won over by its unique taste.","雖然許多人被臭豆腐的氣味嚇退(倒胃口),但敢嘗試的人通常會被它獨特的味道征服。"]],"put on":[["leader-115-55","put on","穿上",2]],"put out":[["leader-115-55","This is a non-smoking restaurant. Please \u0001put out\u0002 your cigarette at once.","這是禁菸餐廳,請立刻熄滅你的香菸。"]],"put through":[["leader-111-38","Receptionist: I'll \u0001put you through\u0002.",""],["guide-112-53","Can you put me through to Peter Scott?","你能幫我接通 Peter Scott 嗎?",2]],"queue up":[["leader-108-39","Many people are \u0001queuing up\u0002 outside the hall for tickets to the concert featuring a talented pianist.","許多人在會堂外排隊買這場才華洋溢鋼琴家演奏會的票。"]],"rail route":[["leader-107-24","As flying becomes increasingly time-consuming and less attractive, a new London-to-Amsterdam \u0001rail route\u0002 could steal passengers from the skies.","隨著搭飛機越來越費時、吸引力下降,一條新的倫敦到阿姆斯特丹鐵路線可能搶走空中的乘客。"]],"railroad company":[["guide-107-80","Several \u0001railroad companies\u0002 are taking advantage of the nostalgia for train travel: They are offering unique tours for travelers who aren't in a hurry and who enjoy the romance of the past.","",4]],"rain cats and dogs":[["guide-111-63","It is \u0001raining cats and dogs\u0002 outside, because there is a typhoon hitting Taiwan now.","外面下著傾盆大雨,因為現在有颱風正侵襲台灣。"]],"range from ... to ...":[["guide-109-4","Visitor: I'd like some information about accommodations, please. Information center: The hotel price in this area \u0001ranges from 2,000 to \u00023,000 NT dollars.","旅客:我想詢問一些住宿資訊。 旅遊服務中心:這一區的飯店價格從 2,000 到 3,000 元不等。"]],"rank ... highly":[["leader-109-24","Hall: I'm pleased that you \u0001rank our restaurant highly\u0002.",""]],"rave about":[["guide-106-71","She \u0001raves about\u0002 places that are off of many traveling cyclists' radar, such as northern Argentina, parts of Australia and the Canary Islands, or Chile's Atacama desert.","",1]],"recreation site":[["leader-113-2","The Forestry and Nature Conservation Agency has been developing forest \u0001recreation sites\u0002 to cater to the citizens' leisure and entertainment needs.","林業及自然保育署一直在開發森林遊憩場所,以滿足民眾休閒娛樂需求。"]],"recycling rate":[["leader-109-78","But the developed world, especially in countries with low \u0001recycling rates\u0002, also has trouble properly collecting discarded plastics.","",4]],"red envelope":[["guide-108-50","At wedding receptions, guests bless the newlyweds by giving them \u0001red envelopes\u0002 filled with money.","在婚宴上,賓客用裝了錢的紅包祝福新人。"]],"refer to":[["leader-106-3","Unlike local people, you'll carry guide books, \u0001refer to\u0002 maps, take photos and look up at buildings.","不像當地人,你會帶著旅遊書、查閱地圖、拍照、抬頭看建築。"],["leader-108-47","Dairy products \u0001refer to\u0002 foods such as butter and cheese that are made from milk.","乳製品指的是由牛奶製成的食物,如奶油和起司。"]],"refrain from":[["guide-111-5","What do we call someone who \u0001refrains from\u0002 consuming meat, eggs, dairy products, and any other animal-derived substances?","我們稱不吃肉、蛋、奶類製品及任何動物性物質的人為什麼?→純素者。"]],"refuse entry":[["guide-114-70","In international practice, most countries and territories may \u0001refuse entry\u0002 to a foreign visitor if their passport will expire less than six months after the date of arrival.","依國際慣例,若外國旅客的護照在抵達日後不到六個月就到期,多數國家與地區可能拒絕其入境。"]],"regard as":[["leader-106-57","In some parts of the world, sheep's eyes are \u0001regarded as\u0002 a great delicacy.","在世界某些地方,羊眼被視為一道珍饈美味。"],["guide-108-75","Over the history of the development of therapeutic spas, hot springs have been \u0001regarded as\u0002 a valuable resource for preventive health care in many countries.","",4]],"regardless of":[["guide-110-17","The yoga instructor believes that yoga should be accessible to all people \u0001regardless of\u0002 body-type, level of athleticism, and age.","這位瑜伽老師相信,不論體型、運動能力和年齡,瑜伽都應該人人都能接觸/從事。"]],"registration form":[["leader-114-40","The \u0001registration form\u0002 asks for an emergency contact in case you fall ill during your travels.","報名表要求填寫緊急聯絡人,以防你旅行中生病。"]],"remain seated":[["leader-111-9","Please \u0001remain seated\u0002 for your own safety.",""]],"rental company":[["guide-115-27","Renting a 1,500c.c. five-seater car allows for 48 hours of use. Before picking up the vehicle, please call the \u0001rental company\u0002 to assist you in arranging the pickup.","租一輛 1,500c.c. 五人座車可使用 48 小時。取車前,請致電租車公司協助安排取車。"]],"repeat business":[["leader-114-54","In the tourism industry, maintaining strong relationships with each client is essential for \u0001repeat business\u0002 and referrals.","在觀光業,與每位客戶維持良好關係,對回頭生意和轉介至關重要。"]],"replace ... with":[["leader-113-33","The Geopark employs various methods to conserve water, including rainwater harvesting and a closed-loop filtration system, while also \u0001replacing groundwater with\u0002 recharge wells.","地質公園採用多種節水方法,包括雨水收集與閉迴路過濾系統,同時也用回補井取代地下水。"]],"Resident Certificate":[["guide-112-4","Foreigners without an ROC (Taiwan) \u0001Resident Certificate\u0002 are required to fill in an Arrival Card.","沒有中華民國(台灣)居留證的外國人須填寫入境登記卡。"]],"resort hotel":[["guide-108-56","A \u0001resort hotel\u0002 is a venue where travelers can relax. Accordingly, they emphasize recreational amenities such as saunas, swimming pools, etc.","度假飯店是讓旅客放鬆的場所,因此它們強調三溫暖、游泳池等休閒設施。"]],"rest period":[["leader-107-70","Uber drivers will now be forced to take a six-hour break after a total of 12 hours of driving time. Drivers will not be able to accept new riders during that \u0001rest period\u0002.","Uber 司機累計開 12 小時後,將被強制休息六小時。休息期間不能接新乘客。"]],"retail giant":[["leader-111-71","There, online \u0001retail giant\u0002 Alibaba directs the service through its Ele.me food delivery brand.","",1]],"return the car":[["guide-113-41","Don't forget to fill the gas tank before \u0001returning the car\u0002. This will save you extra fuel and service fees.","還車前別忘了把油箱加滿。這能為你省下額外的油費與服務費。"]],"return ticket":[["leader-113-35","Information Center Assistant: It is $2 for a single ticket, and $3 for a \u0001return ticket\u0002.",""]],"right away":[["leader-112-51","I will send a maintenance staff up \u0001right away\u0002.",""],["leader-114-6","Time is running out, so we must deal with the problem \u0001right away\u0002.","時間快用完了,我們必須立刻處理這個問題。"]],"right of entry":[["guide-113-7","Airports with international flights have customs and immigration facilities, which allow \u0001right of entry\u0002 into a country.","有國際航班的機場設有海關與證照查驗(入境)設施,允許入境一個國家。"]],"right over":[["guide-112-33","B: I'll be \u0001right over\u0002, Ms.",""]],"river basin":[["guide-114-2","The \u0001river basins\u0002 that converge in Kaohsiung have been crucial for its early civilization.","匯聚於高雄的河流流域,對其早期文明發展至關重要。"]],"rock formation":[["guide-108-18","After taking in the \u0001rock formations\u0002 of the Northeast Coast, it's time to head to the legendary gold mining town of Jinguashi.","欣賞完東北角的岩石地形後,該前往傳奇的金瓜石採金小鎮了。"],["guide-113-9","The park's landscape features unique coastal \u0001rock formations\u0002 shaped by natural forces over several million years.","這座公園的地景以…為特色,擁有由自然力量歷經數百萬年塑造的獨特海岸岩層。"]],"rocket to fame":[["guide-109-40","Chen Guan-zhou used over 40,000 Lego pieces to make Longshan Temple, which made him \u0001rocket to fame\u0002 in the field.","陳冠州用超過四萬塊樂高做出龍山寺,這讓他在這領域一舉成名。"]],"roll-neck sweater":[["guide-108-68","I love the \u0001roll-neck sweater\u0002 in blue, but I don't know what my size is. Could you please take my measurements?","我很喜歡這件藍色高領毛衣,但不知道我的尺寸,能幫我量尺寸嗎?"]],"room for negotiation":[["leader-113-49","A: Is there any \u0001room for negotiation\u0002 on the price? B: Certainly, there is some room for negotiation on the price.","A:價格有商量的空間嗎? B:當然,價格有一些商量空間。"]],"round trip":[["guide-112-56","Passenger: What's the bus fare to The Metropolitan Museum of Art? John: Two dollars one way, three dollars \u0001round trip\u0002.","乘客:到大都會藝術博物館的公車票價多少? John:單程兩美元,來回三美元。"]],"routine inspection":[["guide-108-27","When you arrive at the destination airport, you must go through the Customs for a \u0001routine inspection\u0002.","抵達目的地機場時,你必須通過海關接受例行檢查。"]],"royal family":[["leader-108-70","Last night a banquet was held at Buckingham Palace. All the members of The \u0001Royal Family\u0002 attended the dinner party.","昨晚白金漢宮舉辦一場宴會。所有王室成員都出席了這場晚宴。"]],"rule of thumb":[["leader-113-76","A good \u0001rule of thumb\u0002 is to ensure your passport is valid when booking your flight.","",1],["guide-110-32","As a \u0001rule of thumb\u0002, you need to be at the airport at least 3 hours before the official time of departure when flying international.","一般經驗法則,搭國際線時你需要在正式起飛時間前至少 3 小時抵達機場。"]],"rumor has it":[["guide-109-12","\u0001Rumor has it\u0002 that a monster called 'Nian' attacked people and animals in the village.","傳說有一隻叫「年」的怪獸攻擊村裡的人和動物。"]],"run from ... to":[["leader-110-70","John: The afternoon tea hours \u0001run from 2 pm to\u0002 4 pm.",""]],"run out":[["leader-114-6","Time is \u0001running out\u0002, so we must deal with the problem right away.","時間快用完了,我們必須立刻處理這個問題。"]],"run out of":[["leader-107-11","It was only a four-hour drive to cross the desert and reach the coastal city, but we \u0001ran out of\u0002 gas before we could reach the destination.","越過沙漠、到那座海岸城市只要開四小時車,但我們在抵達目的地前就沒油了。"]],"run rampant":[["guide-110-68","Organized crime has \u0001run rampant\u0002 due to the inaction of the government.","由於政府的無作為,組織犯罪已猖獗橫行。"]],"safety instructions":[["guide-111-8","Please pay close attention to the \u0001safety instructions\u0002 even if you are a frequent flyer.","即使你是常飛的旅客,也請密切注意安全須知。"]],"sandy beach":[["guide-109-77","Sandy beaches","沙灘",3]],"satellite town":[["guide-114-30","Taiwan's metro system has been praised by locals for its effectiveness in relieving growing traffic congestion in Taipei and its surrounding \u0001satellite towns\u0002.","台灣的捷運系統因有效紓解台北及周邊衛星城鎮日益嚴重的交通壅塞,而受到當地人稱讚。"]],"save up":[["guide-107-53","Some people spent years \u0001saving up\u0002 money in order to take a long-term dream trip.","有些人花好幾年存錢,為了去一趟長期的夢想之旅。"]],"scenic spot":[["guide-112-48","Mineral fields used to be a marvelous \u0001scenic spot\u0002 but it has lost its appeal in recent years.","礦區曾是絕妙的風景勝地,但近年來已失去了它的吸引力。"]],"science fiction":[["guide-107-75","A science fiction","科幻小說",2]],"Scope 3 emissions":[["leader-115-79","These include emission measurement, especially \u0001Scope 3 emissions\u0002, the fragmented regulatory landscape, inconsistencies in reporting standards and insufficient budgets remains issues.","",4]],"scuba diving":[["leader-109-29","Some tour companies advertise jungle treks, \u0001scuba diving\u0002, and other expeditions as \"nature tourism\".","有些旅行社把叢林健行、潛水和其他探險活動宣傳為「自然旅遊」。"],["leader-112-77","They come for \u0001scuba diving\u0002, SUP (stand-up paddling), snorkeling, and so on.","",4]],"sea breeze":[["leader-113-58","Cruising through the Caribbean, passengers enjoyed the warm \u0001sea breeze\u0002 and crystal-clear waters.","搭郵輪航行加勒比海時,乘客享受溫暖海風和清澈海水。"]],"sea turtle":[["leader-108-27","Like many other marine animals, \u0001sea turtles\u0002 mistake plastic waste for a viable food source, sometimes causing blockages in their digestive system.","像許多其他海洋動物一樣,海龜把塑膠垃圾誤認為可吃的食物,有時造成消化道阻塞。"]],"seat belt":[["leader-110-23","Wearing \u0001seat belts\u0002 is mandatory in all vehicles for drivers globally.","全球所有車輛的駕駛都強制規定要繫安全帶。"],["leader-112-15","Ladies and gentlemen, please fasten your \u0001seat belts\u0002 for landing.","各位女士先生,降落前請繫好安全帶。"]],"seat selection":[["guide-114-64","To improve the service quality, some airlines offer passengers advance \u0001seat selection\u0002 service, allowing them to pre-select their seats online.","為提升服務品質,有些航空公司提供旅客預先選位服務,讓他們可在線上事先選好座位。"]],"seating chart":[["guide-113-70","Let me check the \u0001seating chart\u0002. … I am sorry, Madame, but all the seats are occupied in this flight.",""]],"security check":[["leader-109-17","When going through the \u0001security check\u0002, you need to put all carry-on luggage on the conveyor.","通過安檢時,你需要把所有隨身行李放上輸送帶。"],["leader-110-67","When going through the \u0001security check\u0002, you need to empty your water bottle.","通過安檢時,你需要倒空你的水瓶。"]],"security officer":[["leader-114-46","The \u0001security officer\u0002 had to confiscate the prohibited items from the passenger's luggage.","安檢人員必須從乘客行李中沒收違禁品。"]],"selfie booth":[["leader-107-71","Now comes a new phase: \u0001selfie booths\u0002, which some stores are providing as a sort of next-generation photo kiosks.","",1]],"selfie stick":[["guide-109-76","The same data reflect many of the world's least-visited countries and territories, where you'll find gorgeous natural beauty, culture and history without pushing through bunches of \u0001selfie sticks\u0002.","",1],["guide-109-78","“Bunches of \u0001selfie sticks\u0002” is an indication of tourist crowd.","「成堆的自拍棒」代表什麼?"]],"send money":[["guide-106-3","The service of PayPal gives people simpler ways to \u0001send money\u0002 without sharing financial information.","PayPal 的服務讓人們能以更簡單的方式匯款,而不必分享財務資訊。"]],"senior citizen":[["leader-109-70","Flight attendants can help \u0001senior citizens\u0002 to lift and stow their hand carry luggage to the overhead bins.","空服員可協助年長者把隨身行李抬起並收放到頭頂置物櫃。"]],"serve as":[["guide-109-41","The National Taiwan Museum tells Taiwan's stories, records her history, and \u0001serves as\u0002 a museum truly for and about the people.","國立臺灣博物館述說台灣的故事、記錄她的歷史,是一座真正屬於也關於人民的博物館。"]],"service charge":[["leader-111-51","In total, your bill is 800, including taxes and 15% \u0001service charge\u0002.",""],["leader-114-51","service charge","服務費",2]],"service desk":[["guide-114-6","The museum offers personal audio guides in Japanese, English, and Korean. Please inquire at the \u0001service desk\u0002.","博物館提供日、英、韓語的個人語音導覽。請至服務台洽詢。"]],"service fee":[["leader-112-47","Changing money at the airport is convenient to get local currency, but you may be charged some \u0001service fees\u0002.","在機場換錢方便取得當地貨幣,但可能被收手續費。"]],"set meal":[["leader-113-31","Waiter: We have two \u0001set meals\u0002.",""]],"set off":[["guide-108-42","To celebrate traditional festivals, various activities are held in streets and in temples. Firecrackers are \u0001set off\u0002 and people go out to enjoy the folk performances.","為慶祝傳統節慶,街上與廟宇舉辦各種活動。燃放鞭炮,人們出門欣賞民俗表演。"]],"set sail":[["leader-107-31","If you are traveling across a body of water, you might make a ferry crossing. You'll have to go to a dock and board before you \u0001set sail\u0002.","如果你要跨越水域,可能會搭渡輪。你得先到碼頭登船,然後才啟航。"]],"set up":[["guide-109-17","\u0001Setting up\u0002 a campfire is the most classic outdoor activity for camping.","生營火是露營最經典的戶外活動。"]],"setting sun":[["guide-106-61","While he was strolling on a beach in Kenting, he casually took a picture of a couple kissing against the backdrop of the \u0001setting sun\u0002.","他在墾丁海灘漫步時,隨手拍下一對情侶以夕陽為背景接吻的照片。"]],"shake hands":[["leader-107-79","shaking hands with people","與人握手",3]],"shall we":[["guide-107-42","Let's call it a day, \u0001shall we\u0002?","我們今天就到此為止,好嗎?"]],"sharing economy":[["guide-110-10","Before the pandemic, microtrips were becoming increasingly common because fares were cheap and the \u0001sharing economy\u0002, like Airbnb, was booming.","疫情前,由於機票便宜且像 Airbnb 的共享經濟蓬勃發展,微旅行變得越來越普遍。"]],"sharp instrument":[["leader-109-59","Other prohibited items include knives, \u0001sharp instruments\u0002, metal nail files, and ski poles.","其他違禁物品包括刀子、尖銳器具、金屬指甲銼和滑雪杖。"]],"shaved ice":[["guide-108-36","Unlike western-style ice cream, \u0001shaved ice\u0002 is a distinctive Taiwanese dessert. People enjoy ice covered with fruit or other tasty toppings.","不同於西式冰淇淋,剉冰是獨特的台灣甜點。人們享用覆蓋著水果或其他美味配料的冰。"],["guide-112-27","People in Taiwan like eating \u0001shaved ice\u0002 with fruit or other delicious toppings.","台灣人喜歡吃加水果或其他美味配料的剉冰。"]],"shift gears":[["guide-112-25","To compensate for the loss of foreign tourists caused by COVID-19 restrictions, Taiwanese travel businesses have \u0001shifted gears\u0002 towards domestic trips.","為彌補 COVID-19 限制造成的外國遊客流失,台灣旅遊業者已轉換方向(改變策略)轉向國內旅遊。"]],"shop around":[["guide-107-16","You can \u0001shop around\u0002 a little before deciding what to buy.","決定買什麼之前,你可以多逛幾家比價。"]],"shore up":[["guide-114-77","Shoring up security measures","強化安全措施",2]],"shuttle bus":[["guide-113-29","If you're traveling to the airport, the \u0001shuttle bus\u0002 will only stop up to two more times after your pickup. By reducing the number of stops, we strive to provide a safer, more efficient, and more pleasant transportation experience.","如果你要去機場,接駁車在載你之後最多只再停兩站。透過減少停靠次數,我們努力提供更安全、更有效率、更愉快的交通體驗。"]],"side dish":[["leader-111-65","Mary: We could provide them with some more complimentary \u0001side dishes\u0002 such as salad.",""],["leader-112-35","Waiter: What would you like to have for your \u0001side dish\u0002? John: I'll have French fries.","服務生:您的配菜想要什麼? John:我要薯條。"]],"sign up for":[["guide-113-35","When you come to Penghu, you may \u0001sign up for\u0002 an island-hopping tour with everything from half-day to multi-day itineraries available.","來澎湖時,你可以報名跳島之旅,從半日到多日的行程都有。"]],"signature dish":[["leader-108-8","Tom: What's the \u0001signature dish\u0002 of your restaurant? Attendant: Clay pot chicken in fermented red rice wine.","Tom:你們餐廳的招牌菜是什麼? 服務員:紅糟醃雞煲。"]],"silver lining":[["guide-110-78","There is a silver lining to the devastating corona pandemic.","毀滅性的新冠疫情也有一線希望。",3]],"single room":[["leader-106-68","The hotel only has a few vacancies left and they are all for \u0001single rooms\u0002.","這飯店只剩幾間空房,而且都是單人房。"],["guide-113-5","Caller: How much are your \u0001single rooms\u0002? Front Desk Clerk: The rates vary depending upon the season and type of single rooms.","來電者:你們的單人房多少錢? 櫃台:價格會依季節與單人房型而有所不同。"]],"single ticket":[["leader-113-35","Information Center Assistant: It is $2 for a \u0001single ticket\u0002, and $3 for a return ticket.",""]],"sit up straight":[["leader-111-8","\u0001Sit up straight\u0002 and get your elbows off the table.",""]],"ski pole":[["leader-109-59","Other prohibited items include knives, sharp instruments, metal nail files, and \u0001ski poles\u0002.","其他違禁物品包括刀子、尖銳器具、金屬指甲銼和滑雪杖。"]],"ski resort":[["leader-106-7","If the beach and the desert lose their appeal, visitors can always go skiing at Ski Dubai, an indoor \u0001ski resort\u0002.","如果海灘和沙漠失去吸引力,遊客隨時可到室內滑雪場 Ski Dubai 滑雪。"],["guide-111-79","Passengers can get off at \u0001ski resorts\u0002 or charming mountain villages along the route.","",4]],"slot machine":[["leader-108-18","In the casino, you can try \u0001slot machines\u0002. You just need to put one coin in and then push the button.","在賭場,你可以玩吃角子老虎機。只要投一枚硬幣然後按按鈕。"]],"small print":[["leader-114-34","Passengers often get upset due to long lines and confusion about ticket restrictions hidden in the \u0001small print\u0002 of discounted fares.","乘客常因長長的隊伍,以及對折扣票價小字裡隱藏的票務限制感到困惑而不悅。"]],"smart cookie":[["guide-111-4","Jimmy learns everything so fast! He is indeed a \u0001smart cookie\u0002.","Jimmy 什麼都學得超快!他真是個聰明人。"]],"smoke detector":[["guide-111-9","Federal law prohibits disabling any \u0001smoke detector\u0002 installed in any airplane lavatory.","聯邦法律禁止停用任何裝在飛機廁所的煙霧偵測器。"]],"so that":[["leader-106-5","Companies use social network sites like Facebook \u0001so that\u0002 people can share information about the brand.","公司利用臉書等社群網站,好讓人們能分享品牌資訊。"]],"social distancing":[["guide-110-25","Given the pandemic situation, getting out of the city and \u0001social distancing\u0002 up in the hills has never been a better idea in Taiwan.","考量到疫情狀況,在台灣,離開城市、到山上保持社交距離從沒像現在這麼好的主意。"]],"social network":[["leader-106-5","Companies use \u0001social network\u0002 sites like Facebook so that people can share information about the brand.","公司利用臉書等社群網站,好讓人們能分享品牌資訊。"]],"soft drink":[["guide-110-33","Would you like something to drink? We have \u0001soft drinks\u0002 and alcoholic drinks.","您想喝點什麼嗎?我們有無酒精飲料和含酒精飲料。"]],"soil sample":[["guide-110-18","The Atacama Desert in Peru and Chile resembles Mars in many ways. \u0001Soil samples\u0002 taken from Mars have been found to be surprisingly similar to those taken from this desert.","祕魯和智利的阿他加馬沙漠在許多方面類似火星。從火星取得的土壤樣本被發現與這座沙漠取得的驚人地相似。"]],"sore throat":[["leader-109-3","Do you have anything to relieve the pain of a \u0001sore throat\u0002?","你有什麼能緩解喉嚨痛的嗎?"]],"Sorry about that":[["guide-109-25","B: \u0001Sorry about that\u0002.",""]],"sort out":[["leader-109-28","The clerk couldn't deal with the guest's complaint, so he asked the manager for help to \u0001sort out\u0002 the problem.","店員無法處理客人的抱怨,所以找經理幫忙解決問題。"]],"sort through":[["leader-106-71","At the train station, the dabbawallas \u0001sort through\u0002 all the lunch boxes and put them onto trains that will bring them to the station nearest the customer's office.","",1]],"source of income":[["guide-106-54","The Maldives depends on tourism as a main \u0001source of income\u0002; many local people would do their best to cater to the needs of foreign visitors.","馬爾地夫仰賴觀光作為主要收入來源;許多當地人會盡力迎合外國旅客的需求。"]],"southern tip":[["guide-115-26","Taking up the entire \u0001southern tip\u0002 of Taiwan, Kenting is a coastal playground that lends itself to everything from diving and windsurfing to a growing surfing scene.","佔據台灣最南端的墾丁是個海濱樂園,從潛水、風浪板到日益興盛的衝浪都很適合。"]],"souvenir shop":[["guide-109-14","At the end of the tour, you'll see a \u0001souvenir shop\u0002 with replicas of almost every item in the exhibit.","行程尾聲,你會看到一間紀念品店,幾乎展出的每件物品都有複製品。"]],"spare time":[["guide-107-36","A: What do you do in your \u0001spare time\u0002? B: I go hiking with friends.","A:你空閒時都做什麼? B:我會和朋友去健行。"],["guide-111-50","Alex has such a strong passion for art that he spends most of his \u0001spare time\u0002 in museums and galleries.","Alex 對藝術有如此強烈的熱情,以致他大部分空閒時間都待在博物館和藝廊。"]],"special deal":[["leader-114-30","To bring more tourists to Taiwan, the government should offer attractive incentive like discounts and \u0001special deals\u0002.","為了吸引更多遊客來台灣,政府應提供有吸引力的誘因,例如折扣和特別優惠。"]],"specialize in":[["leader-110-2","Susan Lee is a sales manager at a travel agency. It \u0001specializes in\u0002 selling flight tickets, hotel reservation, and tours abroad.","Susan Lee 是旅行社的業務經理,該社專營機票、訂房和海外行程。"]],"spectacle frame":[["leader-107-74","At several stores of the optical company Warby Parker, customers unsure if those \u0001spectacle frames\u0002 really fit them can jump into the on-site selfie booth, snap off some images and email them to friends and family for a second opinion.","",4]],"speed limit":[["guide-109-29","A: Could you please drive a little faster? B: Sorry, I'm already going very fast, close to the \u0001speed limit\u0002.","A:能不能開快一點? B:抱歉,我已經開很快了,快到速限了。"]],"speed up":[["leader-110-35","Please tell the kitchen to \u0001speed it up\u0002.",""]],"spin the globe":[["guide-109-80","“\u0001Spinning the globe\u0002 and booking a flight to a country you know little about” is a promotion of adventure travel.","「轉動地球儀,訂一張機票飛往你幾乎不了解的國家」是在推廣什麼?"]],"split the bill":[["guide-109-24","One simplest way to mean \u0001splitting the bill\u0002 can be “Go Dutch.”","表達「分攤帳單」最簡單的一種說法是「各付各的」。"]],"splitting headache":[["leader-112-68","A: I need to buy medicine for my \u0001splitting headache\u0002.",""]],"Spring Festival Couplets":[["guide-108-41","During Chinese New Year, houses are decorated with fresh flowers, \u0001Spring Festival Couplets\u0002 and traditional lucky knots.","農曆新年期間,家家戶戶裝飾著鮮花、春聯和傳統吉祥結。"]],"squeeze in":[["guide-113-51","The manager tried very hard to \u0001squeeze us in\u0002 for a delightful dinner even if the restaurant was fully booked, showing exceptional customer service.","儘管餐廳已客滿,經理仍非常努力地把我們擠進去享用愉快的晚餐,展現了卓越的顧客服務。"]],"stand for":[["leader-115-61","stands for","代表",2],["guide-106-68","The letter A in ATM \u0001stands for\u0002 “automatic.”","ATM 裡的字母 A 代表「automatic(自動)」。"]],"standing ovation":[["guide-107-51","When the athlete pulled off one of his greatest performances, he received a \u0001standing ovation\u0002 from the audience.","當這位運動員完成他最精彩的表現之一時,獲得觀眾起立鼓掌。"]],"start off":[["guide-109-54","A: Where does the tour \u0001start off\u0002? B: At the main entrance.","A:導覽從哪裡出發? B:在正門口。"]],"starting point":[["leader-108-19","I can understand your \u0001starting point\u0002, although I don't agree with it.","我能理解你的出發點,雖然我不同意。"]],"stay in":[["leader-106-26","How many different kinds of accommodation have you \u0001stayed in\u0002 while traveling?","旅行時你住過多少種不同的住宿?"]],"stay warm":[["leader-114-25","Remember to wear several layers of clothes to \u0001stay warm\u0002 during travel to protect yourself from the cold.","記得旅行時穿好幾層衣服保暖,保護自己不受寒。"]],"sticky rice":[["guide-114-53","Pig's blood cake is a popular Taiwanese street food snack made with pork blood congealed with \u0001sticky rice\u0002.","豬血糕是受歡迎的台灣街頭小吃,由豬血凝結糯米製成。"]],"stinky tofu":[["guide-110-41","While many people are put off by the smell of \u0001stinky tofu\u0002, those who take the plunge are usually won over by its unique taste.","雖然許多人被臭豆腐的氣味嚇退(倒胃口),但敢嘗試的人通常會被它獨特的味道征服。"]],"stop by":[["guide-107-37","A: Are you going to drive all the way to Taitung? B: No, we'll \u0001stop by\u0002 in Kaohsiung for a night.","A:你要一路開車到台東嗎? B:不,我們會在高雄過一夜。"]],"stop in":[["guide-112-6","Tomorrow morning, Clement will fly from Taoyuan International Airport and \u0001stop in\u0002 Istanbul en route to his country, Nigeria.","明天早上 Clement 將從桃園國際機場起飛,在前往母國奈及利亞途中於伊斯坦堡停留。"]],"stop over":[["guide-112-38","Usually a transfer passenger will change from one plane to another and \u0001stop over\u0002 at a midpoint for at most 24 hours before continuing the next journey.","通常轉機旅客會從一架飛機換到另一架,並在中途點停留最多 24 小時,再繼續下一段旅程。"]],"stored-value card":[["leader-109-37","Clerk: Do you know what a \u0001stored-value card\u0002 is for? Traveler: Yes, you use it to pay for things instead of using cash.","人員:你知道儲值卡是做什麼用的嗎? 旅客:知道,用它付款而不用現金。"]],"straight ahead":[["leader-107-44","Keep walking \u0001straight ahead\u0002.",""]],"strawberry picking":[["guide-108-78","Tour of strawberry picking","採草莓之旅",3]],"stuffed with":[["leader-108-31","If you want to buy some old pieces of china, the town of Petworth is nearby and is \u0001stuffed with\u0002 antique shops.","如果你想買些古老瓷器,附近的 Petworth 鎮滿是古董店。"]],"subject to":[["leader-108-23","Duty free rules and regulations are \u0001subject to\u0002 change without notice.","免稅規定可能隨時變動,恕不另行通知。"]],"subway station":[["guide-109-48","A: Hi, do you know where the nearest \u0001subway station\u0002 is? B: Go down this street, turn left, and you should see it on your right.","A:嗨,你知道最近的地鐵站在哪嗎? B:沿這條街走,左轉,就會在你右手邊看到。"]],"suffer from":[["leader-109-18","The city is \u0001suffering from\u0002 a(n) severe lack of rainfall at the moment.","這座城市目前正遭受嚴重缺雨之苦。"],["guide-111-24","Many people \u0001suffer from\u0002 nomophobia and therefore never switch off their cell phones.","許多人有無手機恐懼症,因此從不關手機。"]],"SUP (stand-up paddling)":[["leader-112-77","They come for scuba diving, \u0001SUP (stand-up paddling)\u0002, snorkeling, and so on.","",4]],"superior room":[["guide-111-46","You have a \u0001superior room\u0002 reserved for three nights.","您有一間高級房已預訂三晚。"]],"sustainable tourism":[["leader-114-56","Practices that minimize environmental impact and support local communities are key principles of \u0001sustainable tourism\u0002.","減少環境衝擊、支持當地社區的做法,是永續觀光的關鍵原則。"],["guide-115-28","With a growing focus on responsible and ethical tourism, \u0001sustainable tourism\u0002 is becoming an increasingly important industry worldwide.","隨著對負責任且合乎道德的觀光日益重視,永續觀光正成為全球日益重要的產業。"]],"swimming pool":[["leader-108-66","John: Do you have any other facilities in the hotel? Hotel clerk: We have an indoor \u0001swimming pool\u0002.","John:飯店還有其他設施嗎? 櫃台:我們有室內游泳池。"]],"switch off":[["leader-112-1","Flight attendant: Sir, please \u0001switch off\u0002 your mobile phone as we are about to takeoff.","空服員:先生,我們即將起飛,請關閉手機。"],["guide-111-24","Many people suffer from nomophobia and therefore never \u0001switch off\u0002 their cell phones.","許多人有無手機恐懼症,因此從不關手機。"]],"table manners":[["leader-114-62","To have good \u0001table manners\u0002 please gently stir your soup to cool it instead of blowing on it during the meal.","為有好的餐桌禮儀,用餐時請輕輕攪拌你的湯讓它變涼,而不是用嘴吹。"]],"Taiwan Blue Magpie":[["guide-108-37","Taiwan is home to several unique bird species such as the \u0001Taiwan Blue Magpie\u0002, which can only be seen in Taiwan.","台灣擁有數種特有鳥類,例如只在台灣看得到的台灣藍鵲。"]],"take advantage of":[["guide-108-30","Many tourists \u0001take advantage of\u0002 relaxing activities by participating in outdoor sports such as diving, cycling, and hiking.","許多遊客藉由潛水、騎車、健行等戶外運動善用放鬆的活動。"]],"take off":[["leader-107-7","Many people think departure time is when the plane \u0001takes off\u0002. Actually it is when the flight is scheduled to leave the gate.","許多人以為離站時間是飛機起飛時。其實是班機預定離開登機門的時間。"],["leader-115-53","Flight Attendant: Sir, please switch off your mobile phone as we are about to \u0001take off\u0002.","空服員:先生,我們即將起飛,請關閉您的手機。"]],"take on":[["leader-114-2","People who are in the U.S. illegally are not taking native citizens' jobs because they often \u0001take on\u0002 positions that native workers are unwilling to fill, such as agriculture and food processing jobs.","非法居留美國的人並沒有搶走本國公民的工作,因為他們常從事本國勞工不願意做的職位,例如農業和食品加工。"]],"take one's breath away":[["guide-113-19","The view from the mountain peak was absolutely sublime, offering a panorama that \u0001took my breath away\u0002.","山頂的景色絕對壯麗,那全景令我屏息。"]],"take out":[["leader-114-37","When was the last time you \u0001took out\u0002 your wallet?",""]],"take pictures":[["leader-106-37","Tourist: May I \u0001take pictures\u0002 here?",""],["guide-107-35","A: Are we allowed to \u0001take pictures\u0002 once we get inside the museum? B: Taking pictures inside the museum is prohibited.","A:進博物館後可以拍照嗎? B:博物館內禁止拍照。"]],"take the plunge":[["guide-110-41","While many people are put off by the smell of stinky tofu, those who \u0001take the plunge\u0002 are usually won over by its unique taste.","雖然許多人被臭豆腐的氣味嚇退(倒胃口),但敢嘗試的人通常會被它獨特的味道征服。"]],"tap water":[["guide-108-57","In Taiwan, guests of the hotel cannot drink the \u0001tap water\u0002. The hotel usually provides two complimentary bottles of water instead.","在台灣,飯店客人不能喝自來水,飯店通常改提供兩瓶免費瓶裝水。"],["guide-111-34","In Taiwan, people boil \u0001tap water\u0002 first before drinking it; however, in Japan, people don't have to.","在台灣,人們喝自來水前會先煮沸;然而在日本,人們不必這麼做。"]],"tapioca balls":[["guide-110-66","Bubble tea is a tea-based drink with chewy \u0001tapioca balls\u0002.","珍珠奶茶(泡沫茶)是一種加了有嚼勁粉圓的茶飲。"],["guide-115-21","Many people in Taiwan like drinking Pearl Milk Tea which usually consists of sweetened tea with milk and chewy \u0001tapioca balls\u0002.","許多台灣人喜歡喝珍珠奶茶,通常是加了牛奶和有嚼勁粉圓(珍珠)的甜茶。"]],"target language":[["guide-114-43","An interpreter is a person who converts a thought or expression of a source language into an expression with a comparable meaning in a \u0001target language\u0002.","口譯員是把來源語言的想法或表達轉換成目標語言中意義相當之表達的人。"]],"taste bud":[["leader-109-72","Gourmets with excellent taste buds.","有絕佳味覺的美食家。",3]],"tax free":[["leader-107-32","Global Blue \u0001Tax Free\u0002 shopping brings you additional savings on purchases at over 300,000 stores across the world's best shopping districts.","Global Blue 退稅購物讓你在全球最佳購物區逾 30 萬家商店的消費中額外省錢。"]],"tax refund":[["leader-108-15","I would like to claim a \u0001tax refund\u0002. Do you know the refund application procedures?","我想申請退稅,你知道退稅申請流程嗎?"],["leader-110-40","Emily: I would like to claim a \u0001tax refund\u0002.",""]],"taxi stand":[["guide-111-69","A: How far is the \u0001taxi stand\u0002 nearby?",""]],"tea house":[["guide-110-26","Maokong in Taipei produces more than 60 tons of tea per year, most of which is used up in the \u0001tea houses\u0002 spread across Maokong's hillsides.","台北貓空每年生產超過 60 噸茶,其中大部分都在遍布貓空山坡的茶館裡消耗掉。"]],"tell off":[["guide-111-22","When you discipline your staff, try not to make them feel they are being \u0001told off\u0002.","當你管教員工時,盡量別讓他們覺得自己被責罵。"]],"ten past three":[["guide-106-48","But it's \u0001ten past three\u0002 now and we're still in Tainan.",""]],"terrorist attack":[["guide-106-30","Despite the \u0001terrorist attack\u0002 on the Christmas market in Germany, thousands of people still gathered at the Brandenburg Gate to celebrate the arrival of 2017.","儘管德國聖誕市集發生恐怖攻擊,仍有數千人聚集在布蘭登堡門慶祝 2017 年到來。"]],"text message":[["leader-107-58","Sending \u0001text messages\u0002 over the phone is a very efficient way to communicate. It is faster and easier than calling.","用手機傳簡訊是很有效率的溝通方式,比打電話更快更容易。"]],"that will be all":[["guide-109-65","B: No, \u0001that will be all\u0002.",""]],"the former":[["leader-113-74","According to this passage, stopovers can be different from layover flights in that \u0001the former\u0002 are longer than the latter.","根據本文,stopover 與 layover 的差別在於前者比後者更__。"]],"the latest science":[["leader-115-77","Though many targets are not yet based on \u0001the latest science\u0002, it is promising to see that many businesses are currently in the process of revising and adapting their targets to reach standards like those set by SBTi, and many others, putting climate actio…","",4]],"the latter":[["leader-113-74","According to this passage, stopovers can be different from layover flights in that the former are longer than \u0001the latter\u0002.","根據本文,stopover 與 layover 的差別在於前者比後者更__。"]],"the least":[["leader-110-57","For Jean, the price is \u0001the least\u0002 important thing when she shops for jeans. She cares even more about the shape and the size of pockets.","對 Jean 來說,買牛仔褲時價格是最不重要的。她更在意口袋的形狀和大小。"]],"the majority of":[["leader-115-74","In some cases, \u0001the majority of\u0002 profits go to large, foreign-owned companies, leaving local businesses and workers with only a small percentage of the generated income.","",4]],"the Qing period":[["guide-114-20","Lukang lies along the west coast of Taiwan. It had the largest population in Taiwan during \u0001the Qing period\u0002.","鹿港位於台灣西海岸。它在清代擁有全台最多的人口。"]],"the tube":[["leader-107-30","If you've chosen a self-catering holiday, you'll probably have to get around on your own using taxis, buses, subways - or \u0001the tube\u0002 if you're traveling to London.","如果你選了自理式假期,你大概得靠自己搭計程車、公車、地鐵四處移動——去倫敦的話則是搭地鐵(the tube)。"]],"the way to":[["guide-109-47","A: Could you please tell me \u0001the way to\u0002 the Empire State Building? B: Take exit 4 and you'll see it across the street.","A:能告訴我怎麼去帝國大廈嗎? B:走 4 號出口,你就會看到它在對街。"]],"theme park":[["leader-108-1","There are many attractions for tourists including a \u0001theme park\u0002 and a museum.","這裡有許多給遊客的景點,包括一座主題樂園和一座博物館。"]],"thermal imaging":[["leader-110-15","To keep guests and employees safe, a hotel in Burbank implemented a \u0001thermal imaging\u0002 and fever detection system that can read body temperatures as guests and employees enter the hotel.","為保障客人和員工安全,Burbank 一間飯店導入熱像與發燒偵測系統,能在客人與員工進入飯店時量測體溫。"]],"ticket collector":[["leader-109-5","\u0001Ticket collector\u0002: You need to purchase a new one.",""]],"ticket number":[["leader-111-42","Customer: I would like to confirm my flight from Taipei to Los Angeles. Airline agent: May I have your name and \u0001ticket number\u0002, please?","顧客:我想確認台北到洛杉磯的航班。 地勤:能給我你的姓名和票號嗎?"]],"time zone":[["leader-109-6","People live in different \u0001time zones\u0002. When it's 3 p.m. in Milan, it's 11 p.m. in Seoul.","人們住在不同的時區。米蘭下午 3 點時,首爾是晚上 11 點。"]],"top tier":[["guide-110-23","Do we want to become a country where the \u0001top tier\u0002 remains wealthy beyond imagination, and the rest are working in jobs that help make the lives of the rich more comfortable?","我們想成為一個上層階級富有到超乎想像、其餘人卻在替富人讓生活更舒適的工作中打拼的國家嗎?"]],"total price":[["leader-109-60","The tax is added to the \u0001total price\u0002 at the cash register, not included in the price.","稅金在收銀台加到總價上,不含在標價內。"]],"tote bag":[["leader-112-60","I highly recommend this blue \u0001tote bag\u0002 because of its high quality. It is very durable and water-resistant.","我強力推薦這個藍色托特包,品質很好。它非常耐用又防水。"]],"tour bus":[["guide-107-41","Even if I could drive the \u0001tour bus\u0002, I wouldn't. Let's wait for the driver.","就算我會開遊覽車,我也不會開。我們等司機吧。"]],"tour group":[["guide-112-60","Janet: I haven't been feeling well since I joined a \u0001tour group\u0002 last Monday.",""]],"tour guide":[["leader-109-32","The reason why the \u0001tour guide\u0002 was hired was that she could speak multiple languages, including English, Korean, German, and Russian.","這位導遊被錄用的原因,是她會說多種語言,包括英、韓、德、俄語。"],["guide-106-56","Mary knew a lot about Spain and was fluent in Spanish, so we let her be our \u0001tour guide\u0002 when we were traveling in Barcelona.","瑪麗很了解西班牙,西班牙語又流利,所以我們在巴塞隆納旅行時讓她當導遊。"]],"tour leader":[["leader-113-21","When the flight is delayed, the \u0001tour leader\u0002 should calm the tourists and wait patiently for the airline to solve the problem. Also, the tour leader can ask the airline for compensation.","班機延誤時,領隊應安撫遊客,並耐心等候航空公司解決問題。領隊也可向航空公司要求補償。"]],"tour operator":[["leader-108-21","The \u0001tour operator\u0002 will arrange transport and plan your itinerary.","旅遊業者會安排交通並規劃你的行程。"]],"tour package":[["leader-115-23","In a \u0001tour package\u0002 with a set content, if you want to request an additional service, you might not get it.","在內容固定的套裝行程中,如果你想要求額外服務,可能不會得到。"]],"tourist spot":[["guide-111-21","Many tourists can easily fall prey to the pickpockets in some crowded \u0001tourist spots\u0002.","在一些擁擠的景點,許多遊客很容易成為扒手的獵物(受害者)。"]],"traffic control":[["guide-115-5","Taking a bus to get to Yangmingshan is a better means of transportation during the period of \u0001traffic control\u0002 for the Flower Festival.","花季期間有交通管制,搭公車上陽明山是比較好的交通方式。"]],"traffic jam":[["guide-107-76","Although we complain when our plane isn't on schedule or when we have to wait in a \u0001traffic jam\u0002, we also complain about always being in a hurry.","",1]],"travel agency":[["leader-110-2","Susan Lee is a sales manager at a \u0001travel agency\u0002. It specializes in selling flight tickets, hotel reservation, and tours abroad.","Susan Lee 是旅行社的業務經理,該社專營機票、訂房和海外行程。"],["guide-107-65","Due to increased competition from foreign \u0001travel agencies\u0002, local travel agencies were forced to lower the prices of package tours to attract tourists.","由於外國旅行社競爭加劇,本地旅行社被迫調降套裝行程價格以吸引遊客。"]],"travel agent":[["leader-110-55","It's great that we can buy flight tickets via both phone and internet without calling the \u0001travel agents\u0002. It saves us a lot of time.","我們能透過電話和網路買機票,不用打給旅行社,真好。這省了我們很多時間。"],["guide-115-24","Are you still waiting to hear from your \u0001travel agent\u0002? Why don't you call him?","你還在等旅行社回覆消息嗎?何不打電話給他?"]],"travel document":[["guide-108-54","After leaving the aircraft, follow signs for arrivals and go through passport control. You must show all your \u0001travel documents\u0002.","下機後,循入境指標前往護照查驗。你必須出示所有旅行證件。"]],"travel light":[["guide-111-41","Don't bring too much luggage if you want to \u0001travel light\u0002.","如果你想輕裝旅行,別帶太多行李。"]],"traveler's check":[["leader-111-13","Guest: Could I pay with \u0001traveler's checks\u0002?",""],["guide-108-55","If you want to cash your \u0001traveler's checks\u0002, you must pay a handling charge. We charge a 2% commission on each check.","若你想兌現旅行支票,必須付手續費。我們每張收 2% 佣金。"]],"try on":[["guide-109-30","When shopping for clothing, you can \u0001try the items on\u0002 in fitting rooms before buying them.","買衣服時,你可以在試衣間試穿再決定買。"]],"turn down":[["leader-110-25","turning down","調小",2]],"turn left":[["leader-109-12","Hotel Guest: Could you tell me how to get to the concert hall? Clerk: Yes, just go outside the hotel and \u0001turn left\u0002.","飯店客人:能告訴我怎麼去音樂廳嗎? 櫃台:可以,出飯店左轉就到。"]],"turn out":[["guide-110-13","Unexpectedly, a surprising number of people \u0001turned out\u0002 at the debut of the movie and made the director laugh with tears.","出乎意料地,驚人數量的人出席了這部電影的首映,讓導演喜極而泣。"]],"turn out to be":[["leader-114-8","I didn't expect to meet such friendly people. It \u0001turned out to be\u0002 a great day after all, despite the misfortune earlier in the day.","我沒想到會遇到這麼友善的人。儘管當天稍早遇到不幸,結果這還是很棒的一天。"]],"turn right":[["leader-111-35","Tour leader: \u0001Turn right\u0002 when you leave the hotel.",""]],"turn up":[["leader-107-63","Many airlines operate overbooking policies because a small number of passengers, having made their bookings, do not \u0001turn up\u0002 for their flights.","許多航空公司採超額訂位政策,因為少數已訂位的乘客最後沒現身搭機。"],["leader-110-25","It's pretty hot today. Would you mind \u0001turning up\u0002 the air conditioning a little?","今天很熱。你介意把冷氣開強一點嗎?"]],"twin room":[["leader-112-49","B: Yes, we have a standard \u0001twin room\u0002 available.",""],["guide-107-7","In hotel terminology, \u0001twin rooms\u0002 refer to those which provide two beds.","在飯店術語中,雙床房指的是提供兩張床的房型。"]],"twin-size bed":[["leader-109-38","In these rooms two \u0001twin-size beds\u0002 can be convertible into a king-size bed.","在這些房間,兩張單人床可合併轉換成一張特大床。"]],"typical of":[["leader-115-68","The architecture of this building is \u0001typical of\u0002 the Renaissance age, and many tourists enjoy visiting this place.","這棟建築的建築(風格)是文藝復興時期的典型,許多遊客喜歡來參觀。"]],"umbrella term":[["guide-111-23","Niche tourism is an \u0001umbrella term\u0002 which refers to a specific tourism product tailored to the needs of a particular audience.","利基(小眾)旅遊是一個統稱,指針對特定客群需求量身打造的特定旅遊產品。"]],"under construction":[["leader-112-56","I am afraid that part of the highway to the airport is \u0001under construction\u0002, so you may need to take a detour.","恐怕往機場的部分公路正在施工,所以你可能得繞道。"]],"under the weather":[["guide-115-23","B: I was feeling a bit \u0001under the weather\u0002, so I stayed home to get some rest.",""]],"up close":[["guide-112-78","Aside from getting an \u0001up-close\u0002 glimpse at the animals, tourists can receive insight into their habits and routines from knowledgeable guides on several safari programs that include guided drives within the park.","",4]],"up to":[["guide-106-31","Small as it was, the inn could accommodate \u0001up to\u0002 two hundred tourists.","這間旅館雖小,卻能容納多達兩百名旅客。"]],"upset stomach":[["leader-108-63","There are many natural remedies to help people fight common illness such as colds and \u0001upset stomachs\u0002.","有許多天然療法能幫人對抗感冒、腸胃不適等常見疾病。"],["guide-112-59","Tiffany: Well, I have an \u0001upset stomach\u0002.",""]],"US dollar":[["leader-110-47","Traveler: May I pay by new Taiwan dollar here? Clerk: Sorry, we only take \u0001US dollar\u0002.","旅客:我能用新台幣付款嗎? 店員:抱歉,我們只收美金。"],["leader-110-63","What's the exchange rate for \u0001US dollar\u0002? I have heard that it's a good time to buy US dollar.","美金的匯率是多少?我聽說現在是買美金的好時機。"]],"use up":[["guide-110-26","Maokong in Taipei produces more than 60 tons of tea per year, most of which is \u0001used up\u0002 in the tea houses spread across Maokong's hillsides.","台北貓空每年生產超過 60 噸茶,其中大部分都在遍布貓空山坡的茶館裡消耗掉。"]],"vacation destination":[["guide-111-31","Okinawa is quite a popular \u0001vacation destination\u0002 because of its proximity to Taiwan.","沖繩是相當受歡迎的度假地,因為它鄰近台灣。"],["guide-113-69","Many cities in Japan are quite popular \u0001vacation destinations\u0002 because of their proximity to Taiwan.","日本許多城市是相當受歡迎的度假地,因為它們鄰近台灣。"]],"vending machine":[["leader-114-26","The \u0001vending machines\u0002 offer everything you might need, ranging from snacks to pajamas.","自動販賣機提供你可能需要的一切,從零食到睡衣。"]],"virtual assistant":[["guide-108-80","Which kind of technology enables tourism businesses and visitors to use video to interact and provide services through the \u0001virtual assistant\u0002 platform?","哪種科技讓觀光業者與遊客透過虛擬助理平台以影像互動並提供服務?"]],"virtual reality":[["leader-111-76","\u0001Virtual reality\u0002 tourism trends Virtual reality is another of the major tourism trends disrupting the industry and capitalizing on the technology can give you an edge over rivals who have not yet adopted it.","",1]],"visa application form":[["guide-110-59","The Visitor \u0001Visa Application Form\u0002 can be downloaded from the website of the Bureau of Consular Affairs, Ministry of Foreign Affairs.","訪客簽證申請表可從外交部領事事務局的網站下載。"]],"Visa Waiver Program":[["leader-113-29","Your travel authorization has been approved and you are authorized to travel to the United States under the \u0001Visa Waiver Program\u0002.","你的旅行授權已核准,你獲准依免簽證計畫前往美國。"]],"vital organ":[["guide-110-11","Coronavirus has been described as an invisible bullet, silently piercing human's \u0001vital organs\u0002.","新冠病毒被形容為隱形的子彈,無聲地刺穿人類的重要器官。"]],"wait in line":[["leader-111-27","Guest: How much longer do we need to \u0001wait in line\u0002 before the take-off? Flight attendant: It depends on how many planes are ahead of us.","客人:起飛前我們還要排隊等多久? 空服員:看我們前面有幾架飛機而定。"]],"wait one's turn":[["leader-115-47","Tour Guide: Everyone, please form a queue to enter the gallery in an orderly manner. Tour Member: Okay, we'll \u0001wait our turn\u0002.","導遊:各位,請排成一列,依序進入展廳。 團員:好,我們會等輪到我們。"]],"walk through":[["guide-107-32","A: How long does it take to \u0001walk through\u0002 the National Palace Museum? B: Around four hours.","A:走完故宮要多久? B:大約四小時。"]],"ward off":[["guide-109-13","People decorate their homes with plastic firecrackers to \u0001ward off\u0002 bad luck.","人們用塑膠鞭炮裝飾家裡,以驅趕厄運。"]],"wash the dishes":[["leader-110-51","Jean always puts gloves on to keep her hands away from water when she \u0001washes the dishes\u0002.","Jean 洗碗時總戴上手套,讓手遠離水。"]],"waste your breath":[["leader-106-6","Don't \u0001waste your breath\u0002 trying to explain it to me. I'll never understand.","別白費唇舌跟我解釋了,我永遠不會懂的。"]],"water activity":[["leader-112-77","To enjoy water activities.","從事水上活動。",3]],"water bottle":[["leader-110-67","When going through the security check, you need to empty your \u0001water bottle\u0002.","通過安檢時,你需要倒空你的水瓶。"]],"wax apple":[["guide-107-9","Taiwan has some special fruit that you are not going to see anywhere else, such as pink guava, \u0001wax apples\u0002, and “Buddha's head.”","台灣有一些特別的水果,別處看不到,例如紅心芭樂、蓮霧和「釋迦」。"]],"weather condition":[["guide-109-11","I will keep you updated with the \u0001weather condition\u0002 tomorrow.","我會隨時讓你掌握明天的天氣狀況。"]],"wedding banquet":[["leader-113-18","There are fewer guests showing up at the \u0001wedding banquet\u0002 than the Lins originally predicted.","出席婚宴的客人比林家原本預估的少。"]],"weight gain":[["guide-110-22","Vacations are a much-needed break from life at work and home, but they can cause \u0001weight gain\u0002 because many vacation packages include all-you-can-eat and all-you-can-drink options.","度假是逃離工作與居家生活的必要喘息,但它們可能造成體重增加,因為許多度假套裝包含吃到飽、喝到飽的選項。"]],"weight limit":[["leader-111-25","Your suitcase exceeds the \u0001weight limit\u0002 by two kilograms. You might want to give up some items, or put them away in your carry-on bag.","你的行李箱超過重量限制兩公斤。你可以捨棄一些物品,或放進隨身行李。"]],"well done":[["guide-113-4","Rare, medium or \u0001well done\u0002?",""]],"what ... be like":[["leader-106-34","A: Do you know \u0001what the weather will be like\u0002 tomorrow? B: I am afraid that it will have heavy showers.","A:你知道明天天氣會如何嗎? B:恐怕會有大陣雨。"]],"what time":[["guide-107-39","I didn't know \u0001what time\u0002 the bus would get there.","我不知道公車幾點會到那裡。"]],"white glove service":[["guide-106-73","What is the meaning of “\u0001white glove service\u0002”?","「white glove service(白手套服務)」是什麼意思?"]],"wildlife patrol":[["guide-106-44","Without a permit, a group of cyclists made a bold attempt to transgress into the protected area. Nevertheless, they were soon stopped by the \u0001wildlife patrol\u0002.","一群單車客沒有許可證,大膽企圖擅闖保護區,但很快被野生動物巡邏隊攔下。"]],"window seat":[["leader-106-16","Passenger: Are there any \u0001window seats\u0002 available?",""],["leader-110-64","Traveler: I don't like to be disturbed so I prefer a/an \u0001window seat\u0002.",""]],"winter melon":[["guide-107-23","Pineapple cake, one of Taiwan's best food souvenirs, is made with pineapples or \u0001winter melon\u0002.","鳳梨酥是台灣最棒的伴手禮之一,是用鳳梨或冬瓜製成。"]],"winter vacation":[["guide-110-21","In Taiwan, you don't have to worry about traveling far to find beautiful places that are perfect for a \u0001winter vacation\u0002.","在台灣,你不必擔心要跑很遠才能找到適合冬季度假的美麗地方。"]],"with a difference":[["leader-109-74","Because it offers high-quality food with a difference.","因為它提供與眾不同的高品質食物。",3]],"without a hitch":[["guide-111-27","The annual Dajia Matsu Pilgrimage procession went off \u0001without a hitch\u0002 this year!","今年大甲媽祖遶境進香隊伍順利無阻地完成了!"]],"without charge":[["guide-112-39","All our VIP customers will receive a complimentary bottle of wine \u0001without charge\u0002.","我們所有 VIP 客戶都將免費獲得一瓶招待(免費)的葡萄酒。"]],"without notice":[["leader-108-23","Duty free rules and regulations are subject to change \u0001without notice\u0002.","免稅規定可能隨時變動,恕不另行通知。"]],"wood-plank bridge":[["leader-113-6","Elevated \u0001wood-plank bridges\u0002 are used to separate pedestrian and vehicle traffic, and to provide beautiful views of the treetops.","架高的木棧橋用來區隔行人和車輛,並提供樹梢的美景。"]],"working day":[["guide-115-47","It takes approximately five \u0001working days\u0002 (excluding weekends and national holidays) to process passport applications.","護照申請的辦理大約需要五個工作天(不含週末與國定假日)。"]],"working holiday":[["guide-113-39","The documents required for applications of \u0001working holidays\u0002 in Taiwan are based on the respective bilateral agreements between countries.","在台灣申請打工度假所需的文件,是依據各國之間的雙邊協議而定。"]],"World Heritage Site":[["leader-111-22","Kaeng Krachan Forest Complex is designated as a UNESCO \u0001World Heritage Site\u0002 in 2021. This area is located between the Himalayan, Indochina, and Sumatran faunal with rich biodiversity and home to many endangered plants and wildlife species.","Kaeng Krachan 森林區於 2021 年被指定為聯合國教科文組織世界遺產。此區位於喜馬拉雅、中南半島與蘇門答臘動物區系之間,生物多樣性豐富,是許多瀕危植物與野生動物的家園。"],["guide-106-12","The Taj Mahal was designated as a UNESCO \u0001World Heritage Site\u0002 in 1983 for being “the jewel of Muslim art in India.”","泰姬瑪哈陵於 1983 年被指定為聯合國教科文組織世界遺產,譽為「印度穆斯林藝術的珍寶」。"]],"would like":[["guide-109-26","A: \u0001Would you like\u0002 anything to drink? B: Yes, a coke, please.","A:你想喝點什麼嗎? B:好,一杯可樂,謝謝。"]],"writing system":[["leader-106-25","Even though Mandarin may soon become an important world language, it probably won't be the dominant language because the \u0001writing system\u0002 is too difficult.","儘管中文可能很快成為重要的世界語言,但因書寫系統太難,它大概不會成為主導語言。"]],"youth hostel":[["leader-108-11","Mary: Could you please provide me with some information about accommodation? Travel Agent: Maybe you can stay at the Palace \u0001Youth Hostel\u0002 in the downtown area.","Mary:能提供我一些住宿資訊嗎? 旅行社:也許你可以住在市中心的 Palace 青年旅館。"]],"Zhenlan Temple":[["guide-110-69","The Mazu pilgrimage from Dajia's \u0001Zhenlan Temple\u0002 takes place during the third month of the Chinese lunar calendar.","大甲鎮瀾宮的媽祖遶境進香在農曆三月舉行。"]]};
